<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">Guncei</book>
  <para style="h">Guncei</para>
  <para style="toc1">Guncei</para>
  <para style="toc2">Guncei</para>
  <para style="mt">Guncei</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Theophilus, ka lungpataw e, Jisuh ni a thaw tawknae hoi a cangkhai e naw pueng a kamtawngnae koehoi a rawi e gunceinaw Kathoung Muitha lahoi kâpoelawknaw a poe hnukkhu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lathueng lah tawm lah ao hnin totouh e akong pueng hah ka thut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A due hnukkhu hoi ama teh kahring e lah ka o tie hah hote gunceinaw koe avai moikapap a kamnue pouh teh, hnin 40 touh thung ahnimouh koe a kamnue pouh. Cathut uknaeram kong hah a pâpho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hathnukkhu hoi cungtalah a kamkhueng awh navah Jisuh ni, Jerusalem kho dawk hoi tâcawt laipalah apa koe e lawkkam ring awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lawkkam poe e teh, Jawhan ni tui dawk Baptisma na poe awh, hatei nâsittouh o hoehnahlan Kathoung Muitha dawk Baptisma na hmu awh han telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jisuh hoi cungtalah kamkhueng awhnae koe vah gunceinaw ni, Bawipa a tu maw Isarel miphunnaw hah, uknaeram bout na poe han toung telah a pacei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jisuh ni Pa e kâtawnnae hninthanaw hoi a tuengnaw hah nangmouh ni panue han ngai hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hateiteh, nangmae lathueng vah Kathoung Muitha a tho toteh nangmouh teh bahu hoi na kawi awh vaiteh Jerusalem hoi na kamtawng awh vaiteh Judah ram, Samaria ram, talai a pout ditouh kai kapanuekkhaikung lah na o a han atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hote lawk a dei hnukkhu hoi ahnimae a mithmu vah Bawipa teh kahlun tawm lah a o, tâmai ni a kayo teh ahnimouh ni hmawt awh hoeh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hottelah, gunceinaw ni Bawipa kalvan a luen e a khet awh lahun nah ahnimae a teng hnipangaw kâkhu e tami kahni touh a kangdue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahnimouh roi ni, Galilee taminaw kalvan lah na khet awh teh bangkongmaw sut na kangdue awh vaw. Nangmouh koehoi kalvan lah tawm e Jisuh hah kalvan lah a luen e na hmu awh e patetlah let bout a kum e na hmu awh han, atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hathnukkhu hoi ahnimouh teh Olive Mon hoi Jerusalem lah a ban awh. Hote mon teh Jerusalem hoi sabbath hnin hnin touh lamcei ahla.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahnimouh teh khothung a kâen awh teh a luennae imvan a luen awh. Ahnimanaw teh; Piter, Jawhan, Jem, Andru, Filip, Thomas, Bartholomew, Mathai, Alfe capa Jem, miphun kampangkhai Simon hoi Jem capa Judah tinaw doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahnimouh ni, Jisuh e a manu Meri, napuinaw hoi a nawnghanaw hoi cungtalah lungkânging lahoi thouk a ratoum awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hatnavah tami 120 touh e hmaunawnghanaw teh cungtalah a kamkhueng awh navah, Piter ni a kangdue teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hmaunawnghanaw Jisuh man hanelah lam kapâtuekung Judah Isakarot e kong hoi Kathoung Muitha ni Devit koe sut a dei e lawk Cakathoung dawk a thut e patetlah kuep laipalah awm mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Judah teh maimouh hoi cungtalah rawi e lah ao teh hete thaw dawk na kambawngkhai van.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahni teh kathounghoehe kutphu hoi lawhmuen buet touh a ran ei hawvah bungling lah a boteh a von a tangpo dawk a ruennaw hai koung a tâco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hete hah Jerusalem kaawm e naw pueng ni a panue awh teh hote talai hah Akeldama telah a phung awh. A deingainae teh thi talai tinae doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sam cauk dawkvah aonae hmuen teh tami kingdi lah awm naseh, im thung pihai awm hanh naseh. Ahnie thaw a ya ni lawm naseh telah a kâthut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jawhan ni Baptisma a poenae koehoi, kamtawng teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bawipa Jisuh maimouh hoi kamphei teh kahlun lah tawm e hnin totouh a hnukkâbangnaw hoi rei ceionae pueng dawk, maimouh koe kambawng e tami buet buet touh ni Bawipa thawnae kong a pâpho teh kaimouh hoi cungtalah kapanuekkhaikung lah ao han telah Piter ni a pâpho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hatnavah Barsabbas telah a kaw awh teh Justus telah a awitawm awh e Joseph hoi Matthias a rawi awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hahoi a ratoum awh teh, Bawipa nang ni tami lungthin koung na panue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Taminaw pueng e lungthin ka panuek e Cathut, Judah teh ama onae hmuen koe cei hanelah kacangkhaikung thaw, guncei thaw dawk hoi a kâtakhoe teh ahnie yueng lah bout ka tawk hane tami kahni touh thung dawkvah na rawi tangcoung e tami na patue haw telah a ratoum awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hahoi ahnimouh roi hanlah cungpam a rayu sak awh teh Matthias ni a hmu dawkvah ahni teh guncei hlaibun touh hoi mek touksin lah ao toe.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pentikos hnin a pha toteh ahnimanaw teh hmuen buet touh koe king a kamkhueng awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hatnavah kahlî katangpounge pawlawk patetlah kalvan lahoi yah hmatara a tho teh ahnimouh onae im dawk muen akawi pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hahoi teh, hmai patetlah e lainaw kampek e a kamnue teh ahnimouh rip koe ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hahoi teh ahnimouh abuemlah ni Kathoung Muitha hoi akawi awh teh, Muitha ni dei thainae kâ a poe e patetlah alouklouk e lawk lahoi a dei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hatnae tueng nah kalvan rahim e ram tangkuem hoi ka tho ni teh Cathut ka bari e Judah miphunnaw teh Jerusalem kho a roe awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hote pawlawk a thai awh torei teh tami moi a kamkhueng awh teh gunceinaw ni a dei awh e lawk a thai awh navah a kângairu awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahnimanaw ni a kângairu awh teh atu hete taminaw pueng heh Galilee taminaw nahoehmaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hottelah pawiteh maimouh ni mama lawk lahoi lengkaleng thai e heh bangtelane.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Maimanaw teh Parthian ram, Medes hoi Elam ram, Mesopotamia ram, Judea ram, Kappadosia, Pontus ram, Asia ram,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Frigia ram, Pamfilia ram, Izip ram hoi Lubim ram, Rom kho hoi ka tho e imyinnaw, Sairen hoi e naw nahoehmaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Maimouh Judah koe kahmawng e Jentel thoseh, hahoi a tangawn teh Krete tuilum hoi Arabia ram hoi ka tho e lah ao awh. Hateiteh Cathut ni kângairu hnonaw a sak e a dei awh e hah amamae lawk lahoi lengkaleng a thai awh telah a kâpankhai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Taminaw pueng ni kângairu lungkâoun awh teh, hete hno bangtelamaw telah buet touh hoi buet touh a kâ pacei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tami tangawn ni teh a dudam awh teh, hetnaw heh misurtui a parui awh atipouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hatnavah Piter ni guncei hlaibun touh hoi rei a kangdue teh kacaipounglah a dei e teh, Judah miphunnaw hoi Jerusalem kho na kaawm e naw hete hnonaw na panue sak hanelah ka ngai. Ka lawk kahawicalah na thai pouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Atu e tueng heh amom Suimilam tako doeh. Hetnaw teh na pouk awh e patetlah parui awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Het hateh profet Joel ni a dei tangcoung e doeh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A dei e lawk teh, Cathut ni a poe e lawk hah hmalah torei teh tami pueng e a lathueng vah ka Muitha ka awi han. Hat torei teh, nangmae na canu capanaw ni profet lawk lahoi a dei awh han. Nangmouh thung dawkvah thoundoun tanglanaw ni kamnuenae a hmu awh han. Matawngnaw ni mang a sak awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hote hninnaw dawkvah Ka sannu sanpanaw koe ka Muitha ka awi vaiteh profet lawk lahoi a dei awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kalvan lah kângairu hnonaw hoi talai van hai thi, hmai hoi hmaikhu tie mitnoutnaw na patue han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cathut e kalenpounge hninpui a pha hoehnahlan vah kanî a hmo vaiteh thapa thi patetlah kaawm han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hatnavah Cathut min ka kaw pueng ni rungngang lah ao han telah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Isarelnaw ka lawk thai awh haw na panue awh e patetlah Nazareth tami Jisuh ni kângairuhnonaw, kângairunaenaw, hoi mitnoutnaw a sak toe. Hete hno sak e naw lahoi Cathut ni Jisuh teh a kampangkhai toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cathut ni Jisuh teh nangmouh hanlah a hmoun tangcoung e hoi a panue tangcoung e patetlah, kâlawklaipa taminaw kut dawk hoi thingpalam dawk a pathout awh teh a thei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hat nakunghai Cathut ni ahni teh due reithainae thung hoi a thaw sak teh a hlout sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Devit ni hote Bawipa hoi kâkuen lah a dei e teh, kai teh a yungyoe kahring e Cathut doeh kahma lah pou ka hmu. Bangkongtetpawiteh, Bawipa teh kaie aranglah ao dawkvah kai teh takinae ka tawn hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, ka lung a konawm teh ka lai hai a lunghawi. Hothloilah ka takthai ni hai ngaihawinae tawn laihoi a due han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh Bawipa ni ka muitha hah phuen dawk na cettakhai mahoeh. Bawipa e a Tami Kathoung teh pawk sak mahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Bawipa ni hringnae lam na panue sak teh na hmalah lunghawinae hoi na kawi sak han telah a dei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hmaunawnghanaw mintoe Devit teh a due hoi pakawp lah ao teh tangkom hai sahnin ditouh ao rah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahni teh profet buet touh lah ao dawk a catounnaw thung dawk buet touh teh amae bawitungkhung dawk tahung sak lah ao han telah Cathut ni a kam pouh e hah kamcengcalah a panue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Devit ni kamceng lah a panue dawkvah Khrih e boutthawnae kong hah hettelah a dei. Bawipa teh phuen dawk cettakhai mahoeh. A tak hai pawknae hoi kâhmo sak mahoeh a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Cathut ni hote Jisuh hah a thaw sak toe. Maimanaw hai kapanuekkung lah o awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hottelah Jisuh teh Cathut e aranglah tahungnae poe lah ao hnukkhu, lawkkam lah kaawm e Kathoung Muitha hah Pa koehoi poe lah ao. Nangmouh ni na thai teh na panue awh e patetlah hote Muitha hah na rabawk sin toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Devit teh kalvannaw koe luen hoeh rah, hatei, ahni ni hettelah a dei, Bawipa ni ka Bawipa koe,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Na tarannaw na khok toungnae lah ka hruek hoehroukrak kaie aranglah tahung haw atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, thingpalam dawk pathout awh e Jisuh hah Cathut ni Bawipa hoi, Khrih lah a khoe toe tie hah Isarelnaw pueng ni kamcengcalah panuek awh naseh telah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Taminaw ni hote lawk hah a thai awh navah, a lungpuen awh teh Piter hoi alouke gunceinaw hanlah hmaunawnghanaw bangtelamaw ti awh han toung telah a pacei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Piter ni nangmae na yonnae ngaithoum lah ao nahanlah pankângai awh nateh Jisuh Khrih min dawk baptisma rip coe awh. Hattoteh Kathoung Muitha poehno na coe awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, hete lawkkamnae teh nangmouh hoi, nangmae na catounnaw hane hoi, ahlanae koe kaawm e Cathut ni a kaw e naw pueng hane doeh a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Piter ni alouklouk e lawk lahoi a pâpho teh hete tamikathoutnaw thung hoi hlout nahanlah kârungngang awh haw telah ahnimanaw hah a hroecoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Hattoteh Piter e lawk ka dâw e naw ni baptisma a coe awh teh, hat hnin vah tami thong thum tabang a kâthap awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ahnimouh teh gunceinaw e cangkhainae, vaiyei kâraennae, kâhuikonae hoi ratoumnae pou a tawn awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tami pueng ni a taki awh teh, gunceinaw teh kângairu hnonaw hoi mitnout hnonaw moi a sak awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Ka yuem e pueng teh cungtalah a kamkhueng awh teh, a tawn awh e pueng hai reirei a hmawng awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />A tawn awh e hnopai pueng hai a yo awh teh, a pankinae patetlah a kârei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Ahnimouh teh hnintangkuem Bawkim vah a kamkhueng awh teh, im touh hnukkhu im touh vaiyei a raen awh teh, lungthoung lunghawi nalaihoi rawca a canei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Cathut a pholen awh teh taminaw e hmalah minhmai kahawi a hmu awh. Hnintangkuem rungngang lah kaawm e taminaw hah Bawipa ni kawhmoun thung a thap sin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vai touh teh, tangmin lah suimilam kathum nah e ratoumnae tue nah Piter hoi Jawhan teh Bawkim lah a cei roi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A manu von thung hoi kamkhuen e buet touh a hrawm awh teh a thokhai awh. Bawkim kacetnaw ni poe e a coe thai nahan kahawipoung e takhang koe ahni teh ouk ao sak awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Piter hoi Jawhan tinaw Bawkim koe lah a tho e a hmu nah na poe haw titeh a hei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hatnavah Piter hoi Jawhan ni ahni hah kheikhei a khet teh kaimouh na khenhaw! atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahni ni buetbuet touh ka hmu han telah a pouk teh a ngaihawi nalaihoi a khet.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Piter ni sui ngun ka tawn hoeh, ka tawn e hno na poe han, Nazareth tami Jisuh Khrih min lahoi thaw nateh cet atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aranglae a kut dawk hoi a pathaw tahmaca vah khok roi hoi a khoksaluemnaw a thao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A thaw teh lam a cei. Lamtu laihoi Cathut a pholen teh gunceinaw hoi bawkim thung a kâen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hottelah lamcei laihoi Cathut a pholen e hah taminaw ni a hmu navah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />hote tami teh Bawkim meihawi longkha koe kut ka dâw e tami doeh tie a panue awh dawkvah, ahni koe ka kamnuek e hnonaw dawk puenghoi a kângairu awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hote tami ni Piter hoi Jawhan tinaw pou a kuet lahun nah, tami pueng a kângairu awh teh, Solomon e vaikhap koe lah a yawng awh teh a kamkhueng awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Piter ni a hmu nah, Isarel taminaw bangkong hete hno dawk na kângairu a vaw. Hete tami a cei thainae heh kaimouh ni kamamae bahu hoi kamamae hawinae lahoi ka poe thai e patetlah bangkongmaw kaimouh kheikhei na khet a vaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Abraham, Isak, Jakop, ahnimae Cathut, maimae mintoenaw e Cathut ni a Capa e a Bawilennae a kamnue sak toe. Hote Bawipa teh nangmouh ni Pailat siangpahrang e kut dawk na poe awh teh ahni ni hlout sak han pouknae a tawn eiteh nangmouh ni hote Bawipa hah na pahnawt awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kathoung kalan e Bawipa hah na pahnawt awh teh namamouh hanelah tami ka thet e hah hlout sak hanelah na hei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hringnae na kapoethaikung Bawipa teh na thei awh toe. Hatei Cathut ni ahni hah duenae koehoi bout a thaw sak toe. Kaimouh teh hete konglamnaw kapanuekkhaikung lah ka o awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hote ahni e min yuemnae lahoi hote ahni e min teh nangmouh ni na hmu awh e hete tami hah a tha ao sak toe. Hote Bawipa kecu dawk coe e yuemnae ni nangmae mithmu vah hete tami hah kuepcingnae a poe toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hmaunawnghanaw nangmouh koehoi kamtawng teh khobawinaw panuek laipalah hottelah na sak awh tie hah kai ni ka panue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Khrih teh a rucat patang a khang han tie hah Cathut e profetnaw ni a dei tangcoung e patetlah a kuep sak toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hatdawkvah na yonnae ngaithoum lah ao nahan pankângai awh nateh na lungkâthung awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Het hateh Cathut koehoi lungpahawinae tueng a pha vaiteh, nangmouh hanlah rawi tangcoung e Khrih tie a patoun nahane doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cathut ni talai kamtawng hoi kathounge profetnaw koehoi a la dei awh e patetlah bangpueng a katha lah sak kathanae tueng a pha hoehroukrak kalvan vah Bawipa teh ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mosi ni hai nangmae BAWIPA hah nangmae hmaunawngha thung dawk hoi kai hoi kâvan e profet buet touh hah nangmouh hanelah a tho sak han. Ahni ni a dei e naw pueng nangmouh ni na tarawi awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hote profet e lawk hah ka tarawi hoeh e pueng miphun dawk hoi takhoe vaiteh raphoe lah ao han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Samuel koehoi kamtawng teh a hnukkhu lah ka tho e profetnaw pueng ni hai hete hnintha kong hah a pathang awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nangmouh teh profetnaw e catoun lah na o awh. Cathut ni Abraham koe nange catoun dawk hoi talai van e miphun pueng ni yawhawinae a coe awh han telah a pâpho. Nangmouh teh lawkkam e catoun lahai na o awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cathut ni nangmouh buet touh rip e hawihoehnae a raphoe vaiteh nangmouh yawhawi na poe nahanlah amae Capa Jisuh hah a thaw sak hnukkhu nangmouh koe hmaloe a patoun telah taminaw koe Piter ni a dei.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Piter hoi Jawhan tinaw ni tami moikapap koe lawk a dei awh navah, vaihmanaw, bawkim kaukkung hoi sadusinaw teh ahnimouh koe a tho awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />gunceinaw ni duenae koehoi Jisuh boutthawnae kong hah tami pueng koe a dei awh dawkvah, ahnimouh teh a lungphuen awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, Piter hoi Jawhan a man awh teh, khohmo toung dawkvah, thongim thung rum touh a paung awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hateiteh, Cathut lawkkatang ka thai ni teh ka yuem e tami tongpa dueng 5,000 touh a pha awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Atangtho vah khobawinaw, kacuenaw, cakathutkungnaw teh Jerusalem vah a kamkhueng awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vaihma kacue Annas, Kaiaphas, Jawhan, Alexander hoi vaihma kacuenaw pueng hai a kamkhueng awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahnimouh ni Piter hoi Jawhan teh tamimaya hmalah a kangdue sak awh teh api kâ lahoi maw, api min lahoi maw hete hno heh na sak awh vaw telah a pacei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hatnavah Piter teh Kathoung Muitha hoi akawi teh khobawinaw hoi kacuenaw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />sahnin vah kaimouh ni a tha kayoun e tami buet touh kabawp awh e hah lawk na ceng awh dawkvah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />nangmouh abuemlahoi Isarelnaw abuemlah panue sak hanlah ka ngai e teh, thingpalam dawk na pathout awh ei, duenae koehoi Cathut ni a thaw sak e Nazareth tami Jisuh Khrih min lahoi hete tami ni a dam teh nangmae hmalah a kangdue e doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hote Bawipa teh im kasakkungnaw ni na pahnawt awh e talung, patopatang poung e takinlung lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hote Bawipa min hloilah kalvan rahim taminaw koevah ka rungngang thai e rungngangnae min alouke awmhoeh telah Piter ni a pâpho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lawkcengkungnaw ni Piter hoi Jawhan e taran ahawi roinae hah a hmu awh navah, a kângairu awh. Hatnavah, ahnimouh roi teh Jisuh hoi reirei kaawm e tie hah a panue awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hahoi, ahnimouh koe damnae kahmawt e tami hai ahnimouh koe a kangdue e a hmu awh navah banghai oun hane tawn hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hatnavah, ahnimouh ni gunceinaw sanhedrin lawkcengnae imthung hoi a tâco hanelah kâ a poe awh teh bangtelamaw ti awh han telah amamouh dueng a kâpan awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahnimanaw heh bangtelamaw ti awh han. Bangkongtetpawiteh ahnimouh koehoi kângairuhno kamnuek e teh Jerusalem kho kaawm e tami pueng ni a panue awh toung dawkvah maimouh ni oun thai awh hoeh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hete kamthang teh tami pueng koe a kampai hoeh nahanlah Jisuh e min kâuep laihoi hmalah apipatet koehai bout a dei hoeh nahanlah pakhi awh sei ati awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hathnukkhu gunceinaw hah a kaw awh teh, Jisuh min lahoi khoeroe pâpho awh hanh, cangkhai awh hanh telah a cakâ awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Piter hoi Jawhan ni, Cathut e lawk hlak nangmae lawk ka tarawi awh pawiteh, Cathut hmalah a kamcu hoi a kamcu hoeh e hah pouk awh haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kaimouh teh ka thai awh, ka hmu awh e hah pâpho laipalah kaawm thai awh hoeh ‘ atipouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hote kamthang dawkvah tami pueng ni Cathut a pholen awh teh, gunceinaw hah bangtelah hoi ne runae poe han tie a lamthung a hmu awh hoeh dawkvah, ahnimouh ni gunceinaw hah bout a pakhi awh teh bout a tha awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hete kângairuhno lahoi ahmaloe e patetlah ka dam e tami teh a kum 40 hlai a pha toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Gunceinaw teh bout a tha awh navah amamae a huinaw koe bout a ban awh navah vaihma bawinaw hoi kacuenaw ni a dei pouh e hah a dei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahnimouh ni be a thai awh hnukkhu, Cathut koe lungkânging lahoi a ratoum awh e teh, Bawipa nang teh kalvan hoi talai rahak e hnopueng hoi tuipui thung e hnopueng hai na sak, telah ati awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Bawipa ni Kathoung Muitha lahoi kaimae mintoe lah kaawm ni teh na patoun e Devit koehoi bangkongmaw khoramnaw kâpo awh hoeh, taminaw hai bangkongmaw ayawmyin lae hnonaw sak hanelah a kâcai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Talai e siangpahrangnaw pueng a kamkhueng awh teh, BAWIPA hoi Bawipa Jisuh hah tuk han telah ati awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Herod hoi Pontius Pailat bawi teh Isarelnaw hoi Jentelnaw a hroecoe teh, Bawipa nang ni satui na awi tangcoung e, Capa Jisuh hah a taran awh teh hete kho dawk a kamkhueng awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Na pouk tangcoung e lahoi ka tho hane kawinaw hah a kuep sak awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Bawipa atuvah ahnimouh ni pakhinae dawk hoi taran kahawicalah lawk ka pâpho thai nahanlah lungtangnae na poe awh haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Patawnae pueng a roum nahanlah Bawipa na kut dâw haw. Kathounge na San Jisuh min lahoi kângairu mitnoutnaw sak thai nahanlah na poe haw telah a ratoum awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hottelah be a ratoum awh hnukkhu a kamkhuengnae hmuen a kahuet teh ahnimanaw pueng teh, Kathoung Muitha hoi akawi awh dawkvah Cathut e lawk hah lungtang laihoi a pâpho awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Kayuemnaw e kamkhuengnae teh lung suetalah ao dawkvah apipatet ni hai mae hnonaw heh, kama e hno doeh tet awh laipalah, kaawm e hno pueng teh cungtalah hno hanlah a hmoun awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Gunceinaw ni Bawipa e boutthawnae kong hah kalenpounge bahu hoi a kampangkhai awh dawkvah, kalenpounge lungmanae teh ahnimae lathueng vah a pha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ahnimouh thungvah ka roedeng e tami buet touh hai awm hoeh. Bangkongtetpawiteh laikawk, im a tawn awh e pueng hah a yo awh teh, a hmu awh e tangkanaw pueng a sin awh teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Gunceinaw e khok koevah a tâ awh teh lengkaleng a panki e patetlah a rei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Lungpahawinae capa tinae lah kaawm e, gunceinaw ni Barnabas telah a kaw awh e, Saipras tuilum tami, Levih catoun, Joseph teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />a tawn e laikawk a yo e phu, tangka hah a sin teh gunceinaw e khok koe a ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hatei Ananias tie tami hoi a yu Sapphira ni a tawn roi e hnopai a yo roi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A yu hoi lung a kânging roi teh aphu tangawn e a la roi, a tangawn dueng hah gunceinaw e khok koevah a thokhai roi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hatnavah, Piter ni Ananias bangkongmaw nang ni Setan hah na lungthin dawk uk hanlah hmuen na poe teh Kathoung Muitha hah na dumyen teh talai phu a tangawn na kapek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na talai teh na yo hoeh na hai nama e nahoehmaw, na yo hnukkhu hoi hai aphu teh nama e kâ lah awmhoeh na maw. Bangkongmaw hottelah sak hane lungthin thung na kâcai, tami koe laithout laipalah Cathut koe na laithoe atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hote lawk Ananias ni a thai nah a rawp teh a due, hote kong ka thai pueng ni puenghoi a taki awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hahoi nawsainaw a kâen awh teh a ro hah hni hoi a kayo hnukkhu a kâkayawt awh teh a pakawp awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Suimilam kathum touh ao hnukkhu a yu ni bang hno maw ka tâcawt tie panuek laipalah a kâen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hatnavah Piter ni ahni koe nangmouh roi ni talai nâ yit touh maw na yo ka tang tie a pacei nah, ahni ni oe het yit touh doeh ka yo telah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Piter ni hai nangmouh roi ni bangkong lungkânging laihoi Cathut e Muitha hah na tanouk roi. Khenhaw! na vâ ro kapakawmnaw teh takhang koe a pha toe. Ahnimanaw ni nang hai na hrawm awh han atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hatnavah vai touh lahoi Piter e khok koe a rawp teh a due. Nawsainaw a kâen teh a ro a hrawm awh teh a vâ teng a pakawp awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kawhmoun abuemlahoi hote lawk kathainaw pueng ni puenghoi a taki awh teh a pâyaw awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Gunceinaw ni taminaw e hmalah mitnoutnaw hoi kângairunae a sak awh. Ahnimouh abuemlah Solomon e vaikhap dawk lungkânging lahoi ouk kamkhueng awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Alouke taminaw ni ahnimouh teh a ouphlawp a eiteh ahnimouh koe bawk hanelah ngam awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cathut ka yuem e napui, tongpanaw teh ahnimouh koe a kâthap awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Taminaw ni ka dam hoe e taminaw a hrawm awh teh ikhun, phaileinaw khuehoi lam dawk a ta awh. Piter a tho torei teh, ahnie a tâhlip hah tami kapatawnaw e atak dawk a pha hanelah a kâyawm awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Jerusalem tengpam e khopuinaw koehoi tami moikapap naw ni ka dam hoeh e naw hoi kakhine muithanaw ni a man e naw hah a hrawi awh, ahnimanaw pueng ni damnae a hmu awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hatnavah vaihma kacue hoi ahnimouh koe kaawm e Sadusinaw pueng a thaw awh teh puenghoi a lungkhuek awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Gunceinaw hah a man awh teh thongim a pabo awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hateiteh tangmin vah Bawipa e kalvantami ni thongim takhangnaw a paawng pouh teh gunceinaw hah a tâco sak hnukkhu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />cet awh nateh bawkim thungvah kangdout nateh hete hringnae lawknaw pueng heh taminaw koe dei awh telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Gunceinaw ni hote lawk a thai awh teh, amom vah bawkim thung a kâen awh teh taminaw a cangkhai awh. Hatnavah vaihma kacue hoi ahnimouh koe kaawm e naw teh a tho awh. Sanhedrin lawkcengkungnaw hoi Isarel kacuenaw pueng a kamkhueng sak awh teh gunceinaw hah kaw hanlah thongim karingkungnaw hah thongim a patoun awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hahoi thongim a pha awh navah ahnimouh karingkungnaw ni gunceinaw teh hmawt awh hoeh, bout a ban awh teh sanhedrin lawkcengkungnaw koe,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />thongim takhang hai kahawicalah a kâkhan teh karingkungnaw hai thongim hmalah a kangdue e kaimouh ni ka hmu awh. Hatei ka paawng awh navah, a thungvah tami buet touh hai awmhoeh telah a dei pouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Bawkim kaukkung hoi vaihma bawinaw ni hote lawk a thai teh bang hno maw ka tâcawt telah kângairu hoi ao awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hatnavah tami buet touh a tho teh nangmouh ni thongim na pabo awh e naw ni bawkim thung a kangdue teh taminaw hah a cangkhai awh telah a dei pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hatnavah im karingkung ransabawi hoi karingkungnaw ni a cei awh teh, gunceinaw hah a hrawi awh. Taminaw ni talung hoi dei awh langvaih tie a taki awh dawkvah thama lah hrawi awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hahoi gunceinaw teh a hrawi awh teh Sanhedrin hmalah a kangdue sak teh vaihma kacue ni, hote Jisuh e min lahoi cangkhai hoeh nahan nangmanaw teh kâ na poe awh nahoehmaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hatei nangmouh ni Jerusalem khopui dawk na cangkhainae a kâkahei teh ahnie thi teh kaimae lathueng vah a pha hanelah na noe awh bo ma telah a pacei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hahoi Piter hoi guncei alouknaw ni taminaw e lawk ngâi hlak Cathut lawk ngâi hanlah ao atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nangmouh ni thingpalam dawk na pathout awh teh na thei awh e Jisuh teh maimae mintoenaw e Cathut ni a thaw sak toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Cathut ni Isarel miphunnaw yon pankângainae hoi yonthanae poe hanelah Bawi Jisuh teh Bawi hoi Rungngangkung hanlah amae aranglah a tawm teh a tahung sak toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Kaimouh teh hote kongnaw kapanuekkhaikung lah ka o awh. Cathut ni amae lawk kangâinaw koe poe lah kaawm e Kathoung Muitha hai kapanuekkhaikung lah ao telah bout a dei pouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ahnimanaw ni hote lawk a thai navah a lungkhuek awh teh gunceinaw thei hanelah a kâcai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hatei sanhedrin dawk kâpa e Farasi tami Gamaliel, teh kâlawk kacangkhaikung ahni teh tami pueng ni bari e lah a o. Sanhedrin koehoi kacangkhaikung buet touh a kangdue teh gunceinaw hah dongdengca alawilah tâco sak hanlah kâ a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Isarel miphunnaw ahnimae a lathueng vah bangpatet e hno maw ka sak han tie kâhruetcuet awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, vai touh teh Theudas tie tami a tâco. Amahoima tami ka lentoe lah a kâdei teh a hnuk vah tami cumpali touh a kâbang. Hatei ahni teh tami alouknaw ni a thei awh teh ama kayuemnaw pueng a kâkapek teh a kahma awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Hathnukkhu vah milu parei navah Galilee tami Judah a tâco teh amae hnukkâbang hanelah Judahnaw hah a coun. Ahni ni hai a due takhai teh ahnie a hnukkâbang e naw hai alouklah koung a kampek awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Hatdawkvah nangmouh teh ahnimanaw kâbet awh hanh. Tami koe lahoi e pawiteh karawk hane doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hatei Cathut koe lahoi e lah awm pawiteh nangmouh ni na raphoe thai mahoeh. Cathut na ka taran e lah doeh na awm ati. Hattoteh ahnie lawk hah ahnimouh ni a lungkuep awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Hote lawk a thai awh hnukkhu vah gunceinaw hah a kaw awh teh, a hem awh hnukkhu a tu hoi teh Jisuh min lahoi cangkhainae sak awh hanh lawih telah kâ a poe awh teh a cei sak awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Gunceinaw ni Jisuh min lahoi khang hane a kamcu tie a pouk awh dawk sanhedrin lawkcengnae koehoi lunghawicalah hoi a tâco awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Bawkim dawk hai thoseh, im dawk hai thoseh, hnintangkuem a cangkhai awh teh Jisuh teh Khrih doeh telah pout laipalah a pâpho awh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hatnae tueng dawkvah a hnukkâbangnaw moi apap awh toe. A hnintangkuem a paca awh navah, Grik lawk kapan e Hellenist lahmai napuinaw ni kaimouh teh na paca awh hoeh telah Hebru lawk kapannaw phuenangnae a tawn awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hatnavah gunceinaw hlaikahni touh ni a hnukkâbangnaw pueng a kaw awh teh maimouh teh Cathut e a lawk paktoung awh vaiteh canei koelae thaw tawk hane kawi nahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hatdawkvah hmaunawnghanaw muitha hoi, lungangnae hoi, kaawm e tami sari touh nangmouh thung tawng awh. Hete thaw tawk sak hanelah ahnimouh hah kaimouh ni ka rawi awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Maimouh teh ratoumnae hoi lawk pâphonae thaw maha pou tawk awh sei telah a dei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hote lawk teh kamkhueng e tami pueng ni a hnâbo awh teh, yuemnae lahoi thoseh, Kathoung Muitha hoi thoseh, kakawi e Stiven, Filip, Prokhoras, Nikhanaw, Timon, Parmenas, hoi Judah phung lah ka kâen e Antiok tami Nikolas tinaw a rawi awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahnimouh teh gunceinaw hmalah a kangdue sak awh teh gunceinaw ni ratoum laihoi ahnimae lathueng kut a toung sin awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hettelah hoiyah Cathut e lawk a kampung teh Jerusalem kho thung a hnukkâbangnaw hoehoe apap. Vaihmanaw pueng ni hai yuemnae lawk a thai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Stiven teh lungmanae a bahu hoi akawi teh puenghoi kângairunae mitnoutnaw hah taminaw hmalah a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hah navah sanhlout tie sinakok dawk kamkhuengnaw koehoi kamtawng teh Sairen, Alexandria, Silisia ram, Asia ram hoi ka tho e taminaw ni Stiven teh a oun awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hatei muitha lungangnae hoi Stiven ni a dei e hah ahnimanaw ni oun thai awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hatnavah rangpuinaw hah arulah a uen awh teh hete tami ni Mosi hoi Cathut e lawk ka tapuet lah a dei awh e hah ka thai ati awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Rangpui, kacuenaw hoi cakathutkungnaw ni ahni hah a man awh teh sanhedrin lawkcengnae hmuen koe a hrawi awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Laithoe e kapanuekkhaikungnaw a kaw awh teh ahnimouh ni, ahni teh kathounge a hmuen hoi kâlawknaw a tapuet telah kâhat laipalah a dei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hote Nazareth tami Jisuh ni hete hmuen a raphoe vaiteh kaimouh koe Mosi ni na poe e kâlawknaw kâthung sak han ati awh e kaimouh ni ka thai awh toe telah a dei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sanhedrin lawkcengnae koe ka tahungnaw ni Stiven hah kheikhei a khet awh teh ahnie minhmai teh kalvantami e minhmai patetlah ao e hah a hmu awh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vaihma kacue ni Stiven koe, ahnimouh ni a dei awh e heh atang maw, telah a pacei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Stiven ni, hmaunawnghanaw hoi apanaw thai awh haw. Maimae na pa Abraham teh Haran kho a cei hoehnahlan, Mesopotamia ram ao nah ka lentoe e Cathut ni a kamnue pouh teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />na ram hoi na imthungkhu cettakhai nateh kai ni na patue e ram dawk cet haw, atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hatdawkvah ahni ni Khaldean ram a ceitakhai teh Haran khovah ao. A na pa a due hnukkhu hoi Cathut ni atu maimouh onae ram dawk a kampuen sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hatei, hote ram dawk e râw pang hanlah bang tica hai poe hoeh. Abraham ni a ca a cun hoehnahlan Cathut ni ahni hoi catounnaw hanlah hote ram teh râw lah poe hane lawk a kam toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cathut ni ahnie catounnaw teh ayânaw e ram dawkvah imyin lah ao awh han tie hoi hote ram dawk a kum cumpali touh thung san lah ao a vaiteh rektapnae a khang awh han telah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cathut ni ahnimouh san lah ka hno e naw lawk ka ceng han ati. Hahoi ahnimanaw ni hote ram dawk hoi a tâco awh vaiteh hete a hmuen koehoi kai na bawk awh han, telah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cathut ni vuensomanae hoi kâkuen e lawkkamnae hah Abraham koe a poe teh, a ca Isak a sak hoi hnin taroe navah vuensomanae a sak pouh. Isak ni a capa Jakop a sak teh mintoe hlaikahni touh e na pa lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mintoenaw ni Joseph hah a ut awh dawkvah Izip ram lah a yo awh. Hateiteh Cathut ni Joseph teh a okhai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahnie a rucatnae koehoi a hlout sak. Lungangnae hah a poe teh Izip siangpahrang ni Izip ram hoi Faro siangpahrang e a imthungnaw a uk sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hahoi, Izip ram hoi Kanaan ram pueng dawk takang a tho teh rucatnae puenghoi a kâhmo awh dawkvah maimae mintoenaw teh a ca hane tawn awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hatei Jakop ni Izip ram vah rawca ao e a thai navah maimae mintoenaw apasuek lah a patoun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Apâhni lah a cei awh navah Joseph ni a hmaunaw koe amahoima a kâpâpho teh Joseph miphunnaw hah Faro siangpahrang ni a panue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hahoi, Joseph ni tami a patoun teh a na pa Jakop hoi a miphunnaw tami 75 touh e hah koung a kaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hottelah Jakop ni Izip ram lah a cei teh, ahni hoi maimae mintoenaw teh hote ram dawkvah a due awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahnimae ronaw teh Shekhem kho lah a kâkayawt awh teh hote kho dawk hoi Abraham ni Hamor canaw koe tangka hoi a ran e phuen dawkvah a pakawp awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cathut ni Abraham koe lawkkam e atueng akuep e patetlah Izip ram kaawm e taminaw puenghoi a kamphung,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A hnukkhu teh Joseph ka panuek hoeh e Siangpahrang alouke ni Izip ram a uk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hote siangpahrang ni maimae miphun a dum teh, camonaw hah tâkhawng vaiteh hring sak hoeh hanelah a ngai dawkvah maimae mintoenaw a rektap awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hote tueng navah, Mosi a khe. Ahni teh Cathut hmalah a mei kahawipoung e camo lah ao teh, a na pa e im dawk thapa yung thum touh thung khetyawt e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Im dawk hoi a tâcokhai hnukkhu Faro canu ni a ca lah a kawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mosi teh Izipnaw e thoumthainae pueng hah a cang teh, lawk dei koe lahai, tawksak koe lahai a thakaawme lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mosi teh kum 40 touh a pha navah a miphun Isarelnaw khetyawt hane lungpouk a tawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tami buet touh teh Izip tami tongpa ni a rektap lahun navah a hmu teh amae miphun kampangkhai teh Izip tami hah a thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mosi ni a kut hoi amae hmaunawnghanaw hlout nahanlah Cathut ni kâ na poenae kong hah ahnimouh ni a panue han doeh toe telah a pouk ei ahnimouh ni panuek thai awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A tangtho vah, Mosi ni Isarel miphunnaw amamouh hoi mamouh lawkpungnae a sak awh e hah a hmu navah, bangkongmaw hettelah na o awh, atipouh hnukkhu a rahak dawk kâponae a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hateiteh ka yon e ni Mosi a tanawt teh, apinimaw nang hah kaie lathueng vah lawkcengkung lah na ta vaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nang teh paduem e Izip tami na thei e patetlah kai hai thei hanelah na noe maw atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hote lawk hah Mosi ni a thai toteh Midian ram lah a yawng teh, hawvah imyin lahoi capa kahni touh a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A kum 40 touh a kuep hnukkhu Sinai mon dawk e thingyei yon dawkvah, kalvantami teh Mosi koe buruk dawk hmai ka kang e lahoi a kamnue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mosi ni a hmu e hah a kângairu dawkvah kahnai lahoi khet hanelah buruk koe lah a cei navah Bawipa e lawk a thai teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Kai teh na mintoenaw e Cathut, Abraham, Isak, hoi Jakop e Cathut lah ka o ati. Mosi teh a taki lawi vah a pâyaw teh khen pateng khen ngam hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Bawipa ni Mosi hanlah, na khokkhawm hah rading, bangkongtetpawiteh, na kangduenae hmuen teh kathounge hmuen doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Izip ram thung kaie taminaw ni a khang e hah ka hmu. A hramki awh e ka thai teh ahnimanaw rungngang hanelah ka kum toe. Atu cet leih! Nang teh Izip ram lah na patoun han atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Mosi heh Isarelnaw ni a pahnawt e doeh. Maimae lathueng vah apinimaw lawkceng han e, hoi na ka uk hanlah a ta, ati awh. Hateiteh, ahni teh buruk thung kamnuek e kalvantami ni ukkung hoi kahloutkhaikung lah a patoun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A taminaw hah Izip ram hoi a tâcokhai teh, Izip ram, tuipui paling, hoi thingyei yon dawkvah kum 40 touh thung kângairunae hoi, mitnoutnae hnonaw a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Hote Mosi teh Isarelnaw koe, Cathut ni nangmae hmaunawnghanaw thung dawk kai hoi kâvan e profet buet touh nangmouh hanlah ka tâco sak han, telah dei e hah doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ahni teh Sinai mon vah, ahni koe lawk ka dei e kalvantami hoi, maimae mintoenaw cungtalah kahrawngum vah kaawm e taminaw koe ao teh maimouh na poe hane kahring e lawk maimouh koe ka phatsakkung lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hatei, maimae mintoenaw ni a lawk ngâi awh hoeh, ahni hah a hnoun awh teh ahnimae a lungthung vah Izip ram dueng a doun awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Hatdawkvah Aron koe maimouh Izip ram hoi na katâcawtkhaikung hote Mosi teh bangtelamaw ao tie maimouh ni panue hoeh toung dawkvah maimouh hmalah kahrawikung hane cathutnaw hah kaimouh han lah sak awh leih telah a hei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Hottelah hoiyah ahnimouh ni hatnae atueng dawk maitoca meikaphawk a sak awh teh, hote meikaphawk koe thueng hanelah a sin awh teh, amamae kut hoi sak e dawk a konawm awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Hatnavah Cathut ni ahnimouh a hnamthun takhai teh ahnimouh han kalvan âsi, thapanaw a bawk sak. Profetnaw e cauk dawkvah, Isarelnaw nangmouh ni kahrawngum vah kum 40 touh thung thueng hanelah saringnaw hoi thueng e naw teh kai koe ouk na sin a maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Nangmouh ni Molek e rim hoi namamae âsi cathut Rephan hah na sin awh. Hotnaw teh nangmouh ni bawk han kawi lah na sak awh e meikaphawknaw doeh. Hatdawkvah kai ni nangmouh teh Babilon ram hloilah ditouh na hrek awh han telah a thut.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Mosi ni a hmu e hoi kâvan lah lawkpanuesaknae sak hanelah, kâ ka poe e ni a lawk poe e patetlah hote lukkareiim teh kahrawngum maimae mintoenaw koe ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Maimae mintoenaw ni hote rim hah a pang awh teh maimae mintoenaw e hmalah Cathut ni pâlei e Jentelnaw e ram a la awh toteh Joshua hoi hote rim hah a sin awh teh Devit se totouh ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Devit ni Cathut e a lungmanae a coe teh Jakop e Cathut ao, nahane hmuen sak hanlah a ratoum,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Hateiteh, Cathut hanelah im kasakkung teh Solomon doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Hatei, Lathueng Poung ni tami kut hoi sak e bawkim dawk awm hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Hete kong dawkvah Bawipa ni, kalvan teh kaie bawitungkhung doeh, talai teh khok ka toungnae doeh. Nangmouh ni bangpatet e im maw kai han na sak awh han. Bang patet e hmuen dawk maw kai ni ka o han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Hete hno pueng teh kama e kut sak nahoehmaw. , telah Cathut ni ati e profetnaw ni a dei e patetlah khoup ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Na lung a len teh, hnâ hoi lungthin dawkvah vuensoma lah kaawm hoeh e nangmanaw haiyah na mintoenaw patetlah Kathoung Muitha na taran awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Nangmae na mintoenaw ni a rektap boihoeh e profetnaw ao maw, ahnimouh teh kathounge bawi a tho han tie sut ka dei e naw a thei awh. Atuvah nangmouh teh hote Tami Kalan hah ka pahnawtkungnaw hoi kathetkungnaw lah na o awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Nangmouh teh kalvantaminaw koehoi poe e Cathut e phung lawk hah na hmu awh ei, sak han na ngai awh hoeh atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Ahnimouh teh hete konglam a thai awh navah a lungthung hoi Stiven koe puenghoi a lungkhuek awh teh hâ a katâ awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Hatnavah Stiven teh Kathoung Muitha hoi akawi teh kalvan lah a moung navah Cathut e bawilennae hoi Jisuh teh Cathut e aranglah a kangdue e hah a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Khen haw kalvannaw a kamawng teh tami Capa ni Cathut e aranglah a kangdue e ka hmu telah a dei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Hatnavah ahnimouh teh puenghoi hram laihoi a hnâ a tabuem awh teh Stiven koe a yawng awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Ahni hah kho alawilah a sawn awh teh talung hoi a dei awh. Kapanuekkhaikungnaw ni hai amamae angkinaw Sawl tie thoundoun e a khok koe a ta awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Stiven ni, Bawipa Jisuh ka muitha hah dâw leih, telah talung hoi a dei awh lahun nah Cathut koe a ratoum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Hahoi Stiven ni a khokcuengkhuem teh Bawipa hete yonnae teh ahnimae lathueng bawt sak hanh telah puenghoi a hram teh a due. Sawl ni hai Stiven a thei awh e hah a lungkuep van.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hat hnin roeroe vah Jerusalem e kawhmoun thungvah rektapnae a tâco. Gunceinaw hoeh e pueng teh Judah ram hoi Samaria ram lah koung a kampek awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cathutlae taminaw ni Stiven e a ro teh kahawicalah a kuem awh teh puenghoi a khuikakhai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sawl ni im buet touh hnukkhu buet touh a luen teh, ka yuem e napui tongpanaw hah a man teh thongim a paung teh kawhmoun hah a raphoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Voivang lah kâkapek e naw ni lawkkatang teh yuengyoe a pâpho awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Filip hai Samaria ram e kho buet touh dawk a cei teh Khrih e kong hah a pâpho van.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tami pueng ni Filip ni a sak e kângairuhnonaw hah a hmu awh navah ahnie a pâpho e naw hah rip a thai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh tami moikapap koe kaawm e kakhine muithanaw teh hramki laihoi a tâco awh. Kamkhuen e hoi khokkhemnaw hai moikapap a dam awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, hote kho thungvah lunghawinae kalenpoung a tawn awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hote kho dawk Simon tie tami buet touh ao. Ahni teh camthoum e lahoi yah. Samaria taminaw koe kângairu ka sak thai e tami doeh telah a mahoima ouk a kâdei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Camo matawng pueng ni hete tami teh ka lentoe Cathut e bahu doeh ati awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahnimouh ni bangkongmaw a yuem awh, tetpawiteh cam thoum e lahoi kumtha moi kasawlah ahnimouh koe kângairunae a sak dawk doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hatei, Filip ni Cathut uknaeram hoi Jisuh Khrih e min hah a pâpho navah taminaw ni a yuem awh teh, tongpanaw dueng laipalah napuinaw hai tui baptisma a coe awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Simon ama hai a yuem dawkvah tui baptisma a coe teh Filip koe a kâbang. Mitnoutnae hoi kângairuhnonaw hah a hmu awh teh kângairu laihoi hmawn a ngam awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Samaria taminaw ni Cathut a yuem awh toe tie hah Jerusalem khopui kaawm e gunceinaw ni a thai awh navah, Piter hoi Jawhan teh ahnimouh koe a patoun awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahnimouh roi a pha toteh, Kathoung Muitha ahnimouh ni a coe thai awh nahanlah a ratoum pouh roi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, ahnimouh teh Jisuh min lahoi tui baptisma dueng heh a coe awh rah dawkvah, ahnimouh thung dawk api koehai Kathoung Muitha a pha hoeh rah dawk doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hahoi, Piter hoi Jawhan ni ahnimae van kut a toung hnukkhu ahnimouh teh Kathoung Muitha a coe awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Gunceinaw ni kut toung sin e lahoi taminaw ni Kathoung Muitha a coe awh e heh, Simon ni a hmu navah, gunceinaw koe tangka a sin teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />kai ni kut ka toung sin e tami pueng ni Kathoung Muitha a coe awh nahanelah, het patetlah e hnosakthainae hah kai hai na poe haw atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hatnavah Piter ni nang ni Cathut e lungmanae hah tangka hoi ran thai telah na pouk dawkvah nama hoi na tangka teh mek kamko naseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na lungthin teh Cathut hmalah a lan hoeh dawkvah hete thaw dawk nang teh na tawk thai hoeh, nange na ham hai awm hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, na pouknae kahawihoehe hah pankângai nateh Bawipa koe ratoum haw. Hottelah na tetpawiteh na pouknae kahawihoehe naw Bawipa ni doum na ngaithoum yawkaw han doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh nang teh utnae hoi na kawi teh yon thongkabawt e lah na o e hah ka hmu telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Simon ni, nangmouh ni na dei e buet touh boehai kai koe a pha hoeh nahanlah Bawipa koe na ratoum pouh awh telah bout a dei pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Piter hoi Jawhan teh Bawipa e lawkkatang a kampang laihoi a pâpho roi hnukkhu, Samaria ram thung e khonaw koe kamthang kahawi a pâpho roi teh Jerusalem lah bout a ban roi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hahoi Cathut e kalvantami ni Filip koe thaw nateh Jerusalem hoi Gaza kho lah cathuknae lam dawk akalah cet loe atipouh. Hote lamthung teh thingyeiyawn lamthung lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, Filip ni a thaw teh a cei. Hatnavah Ethiopia siangpahrangnu Kandeis e bawi lah kaawm ni teh siangpahrangnu e kâtawnnae kalen lah kaawm e Ethiopia tami buet touh teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Jerusalem vah bawknae a sak hnukkhu a ban navah amae rangleng van hoi profet Isaiah e Cakathoung hah a touk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hatnavah Kathoung Muitha ni Filip koevah hote rangleng koe cet nateh hnai haw atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Filip ni hai rek a yawng sin. Ahni teh profet Isaiah ni a thut e heh vawtvawt a la touk. Filip ni, na touk e hah na thai panuek maw atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hote bawi ni na ka dei pouh e awmhoeh pawiteh bangtelamaw ka thaipanuek han ati teh Filip heh ama koe reirei tahung hanelah a coun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ahni ni a touk e teh, ahni teh thei hanlah sut hmoun e tu patetlah a hrawi awh. Tuca ni muen ngaw navah a hram hoeh e patetlah hram laipalah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A dudam awh navah, ahni kampangkhai api awm hoeh. A hringnae teh talai van hoi takhoe lah ao dawkvah a catoun hah apinimaw bout a dei thai han va tie doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hahoi bawi ni Filip hanelah na pacei haw nei, profet ni api e kong maw hettelah a dei aw. Ama e kong ma aw. Hoeh teh alouke buet buet touh e kong ma aw atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hatteh Filip ni hote kongnaw hno lahoi Jisuh e kamthang hah a dei pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ahnimouh teh pou a cei awh navah tui koe a pha awh teh bawi ni tui baptisma ka hmu hoeh nahanelah bang ni maw kai na rakhan telah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Filip ni, na lungthin abuemlahoi na yuem pawiteh tui baptisma na hmu han, telah atipouh. Jisuh Khrih teh Cathut capa doeh tie hah ka yuem telah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Hahoi, bawi ni rangleng kâhat hanelah kâ a poe hnukkhu, tui dawk a cei roi teh, Filip ni tui baptisma a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tui thung hoi bout a tâco roi toteh, Bawipa e Kathoung Muitha ni Filip teh oun a tawm teh, hote bawi ni hmawt hoeh toe. Hateiteh, lunghawi laihoi amae lamthung dawk pou a cei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Filip teh Azotus kho a tâco teh, Kaisarea ram totouh kho tangkuem Cathut e kamthang kahawi a pâpho.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sawl ni Bawipa a hnukkâbangnaw hah a pakhi teh thei hanlah ngainae a tawn, ahni ni vaihma kacue koe a cei teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Damaskas kho e sinakoknaw koe poe hanelah panue nahane ca a hei. Bangkongtetpawiteh, Bawipa lamthung ka dawn e naw tongpa hoi napui thoseh, a hmu e pueng katek vaiteh Jerusalem lah hrawi thai na hanelah doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hottelah ahni ni a cei teh Damaskas khopui teng a pha navah, kalvan lahoi angnae ni pheng a tue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Talai dawk a rawp teh, Sawl, Sawl bangkong kai na rektap telah ahni koe dei e lawk a thai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawipa nang apimaw, telah a pacei navah Bawipa ni kai teh nang ni na rektap e Jisuh doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thaw nateh kho thung kâen lah, na sak hane thaw na dei pouh han, telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahni hoi kahlawng rei kacetnaw ni lawk teh a thai awh ei apihai a hmu awh hoeh dawkvah muen a ka ngai awh teh lawkkamuem lahoi hawvah a kangdue awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sawl teh hluet a thaw ei banghai a hmu thai hoeh dawkvah, taminaw ni a kut dawk hoi a hrawi teh, Damaskas khopui lah a ceikhai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahni teh hnin thum touh thung a mit a dawn teh rawca cat laipalah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Damaskas kho dawk Ananias tie a hnukkâbang buet touh ao. Kamnuenae lahoi, Bawipa ni, Ananias telah a kaw. Ahni ni, kai hivah ka o, Bawipa, telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bawipa ni ahni koe, thaw nateh, lam kalan tie koevah cet nateh Judah im vah Tarshish tami, Sawl tie hah tawng haw. Bangkongtetpawiteh, ahni teh a ratoum lahun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A kamnuenae dawk a mit kho bout a hmu thai nahanlah Ananias tie a kâen vaiteh a van vah kut a toung e a hmu, telah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ananias ni, Bawipa, ahni ni Jerusalem kho e na tami kathoungnaw koe hno kahawihoehe moi a sak tie tami moikapap ni a dei e ka thai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Vaihma bawinaw koehoi kâtawnnae hoi hivah a tho. Na min kakawnaw pueng man thainae kâ a tawn, telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hateiteh, Bawipa ni cet haw ahni teh Jentelnaw, siangpahrangnaw hoi Isarelnaw hmalah ka min ka sin hanelah ka rawi toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahni teh ka min kecu dawk rucatnae a khang hane naw ka panue sak han, telah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hahoi, Ananias ni a cei teh, imthungkhu vah a kâen. Sawl van vah a kut a toung teh, ka nawngha, Sawl na tho nah lam vah nang koe ka kamnuek e Bawipa Jisuh ni na mit bout ang sak teh, Kathoung Muitha hoi na kawi thai nahan kai na patoun, telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hatnavah, vai touh lahoi a mit dawk hoi tanga lakep patetlah a kâkhawk teh, kho bout a hmu thai. Ahni ni a thaw teh Baptisma a coe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hahoi, rawca a ca hnukkhu a tha bout a sai. Sawl teh Damaskas khovah a hnukkâbangnaw koevah dongdengca ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sawl ni Khrih teh Cathut e ca doeh telah sinakoknaw dawk tang a pâpho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hote lawk ka thai e naw abuemlah ni kângairu awh teh, hete tami teh Jerusalem kho e Bawipa min kakawnaw raphoe hanlah ka kâyawm e tami nahoehmaw, Ahnimanaw katek vaiteh vaihma bawinaw koevah hrawi hanelah hivah ka tho e nahoehmaw telah ati awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hatei, Sawl teh a tha hoe ao. Jisuh teh Khrih doeh ati teh kampangkhai dawkvah Damaskas kho kaawm e Judahnaw hah a kângairu sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A hnin moi ao toteh, Judahnaw ni Sawl hah thei hanlah kho a khang awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hatei, Sawl ni a khokhang awh e a panue. Sawl thei hanelah kho a khang awh dawkvah tangmin tangtho longkha hah a ring awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hatnavah, a hnukkâbangnaw ni Sawl hah a hrawi awh teh, tangmin vah tapawm dawk hoi kho kalupnae rapan hloilah a pabo awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Sawl ni Jerusalem a pha navah, a hnukkâbangnaw koe huiko hanlah a panki eiteh a yuem awh hoeh dawkvah a taki awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hatei Barnabas koevah bangtelamaw, Bawipa a hmu teh, Bawipa ni Sawl koe bangtelamaw lawk a dei tie naw hoi Damaskas kho dawk Jisuh min taranhawi lahoi a pâpho e kongnaw kacaicalah a dei pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Sawl teh Jerusalem vah gunceinaw hoi rei a ceio navah, Bawipa min lahoi taranhawi laihoi a pâpho awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Sawl teh Grik lawk ka dei e Judahnaw hoi a kâoun awh teh ahnimouh ni Sawl teh thei hanlah a kâcai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hote kong hah a hmaunawnghanaw ni a thai awh navah, Kaisarea kho lah a ceikhai awh teh, Tarshish kho lah a patoun awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hatnavah Judah kho, Galilee kho, Samaria kho kaawm e kawhmoun pueng ni teh karoumcalah ao awh. Ahnimanaw ni Bawipa takinae dawk thoseh, Kathoung Muitha e thapoenae dawk hai thoseh, a hring awh teh tami hoe a pung awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Piter ni hnintangkuem kahlawng a cei teh Lidda khovah a pha. Hote kho dawk kaawm e tami kathoungnaw koe a pai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hote kho dawkvah Aeneas tie tami teh kum taroe touh thung a kamkhuen teh ikhun dawk sut ayan e hah a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hatnavah Piter ni Aeneas koe Jisuh ni nang teh na dam sak toe, thaw nateh na iphah kalawng leih, atipouh navah ahni teh hluet tang a thaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Lidda kho hoi Sharon kho e kaawm e naw ni ahni a hmu awh navah Cathut koe lah a lungkâthung awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Joppa kho kaawm e Dawka tie Tabitha teh a hnukkâbang e napui buet touh lah ao. Ahni teh hnokahawi pou ka sak ni teh poenae lahoi thaw ka tawk e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Hatnae hnin navah ahni teh a pataw dawk a due. Taminaw ni a ro teh tui a pâhluk awh hnukkhu imvan e irakhan dawk a ta awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Joppa kho pui teh Lidda khopui hoi a hnai dawkvah Lidda khothung vah Piter ao tie a hnukkâbangnaw ni a thai toteh ahni koe tami kahni touh a patoun awh. Kaimanaw koevah karang tho ei telah ati pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, Piter ni hluet a thaw teh ahnimouh hoi imvan e rakhan thung cungtalah a kâen. Piter a pha toteh lahmainunaw ni Piter e a teng a kangdue awh teh a kâ awh. Ahnimanaw ni Dawka a hring nah a khui e khohnanaw a pâtue awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Piter ni ahnimanaw alawilah a tâco sak hnukkhu, a khokcuengkhuem teh a ratoum. Hahoi a ro koe lah a kamlang teh Tabitha thaw leih atipouh navah ahni teh a mit a padai teh Piter hah a hmu toteh a thaw teh a tahung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Hahoi Piter ni Dawka hah a kut dawk hoi a pathaw teh a kangdue sak. Tami kathoungnaw hoi lahmainunaw a kaw teh bout a hring toe telah ahnimouh koe a patue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Hote kamthang teh Joppa kho thung pueng dawk a kamthang teh tami moikapap ni Bawipa a yuem awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Hot hnukkhu hoi Piter teh Joppa kho dawk phaivuen ka sak e Simon im vah hnin ka saw lah ao.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kaisarea kho dawk Itali ransahu tie ransa cum touh kaukkung Konilias teh ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahni teh bawknae koe lah kâyawm poung e lah ao, a imthung ni Cathut ka bari e lah ao awh teh, Judah tami dawk e karoedengnaw a kabawp teh Cathut koe pou a ratoum,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hnin touh teh tangmin lah suimilam kathum tapat navah vision kacaicalah a hmu. Hote vision a hmu e dawk, Cathut e kalvantami buet touh a kâen teh Konilias telah a pato.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kalvantami hah lungpuen lahoi khei a khet teh bangne Bawipa telah ati. Kalvantami ni yah Cathut ni na ratoumnae hoi karoedengnaw na kabawp e poehnonaw teh pâkuem hane kawi lah Cathut hmalah a pha toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hatdawkvah atu Joppa khovah tami patoun nateh a min Piter tie Simon hah kaw sak loe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahni teh tuipui teng kaawm e phaivuen ka sak e Simon im a luen telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hottelah ka dei e kalvantami a cei hnukkhu Konilias ni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />a vaica kahni touh hoi Cathut lawk dawk kaawm e ransa buet touh a kaw teh Joppa kho lah a patoun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Atangtho teh Joppa kho a pha tawmlei suimilam kahni kalekkalak nah Piter teh ratoum hanlah lemphu van a luen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A vonhlam teh ayânaw ni coungkacoe lah rawca a lawng lahun nah, Piter ni kamnuenae a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kalvan kamawng teh hni hoi ka kâvan e a takin pali touh e talai dawk ama koe ka bawt e hah a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hote tangoung thungvah tava phunkuep, kâroe e phunkuep, saring phunkuep ao. Hathnukkhu Piter thaw nateh, thet nateh cat haw tie lawk a thai navah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Piter ni coung thai hoeh Bawipa,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />kathounghoehe hno, kakhin e hnonaw kai ni vai touh hai ka cat boihoeh atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hathnukkhu apâhni lawk bout ka tho e teh Cathut ni a thoung tie hno hah thoung hoeh telah dei hanh atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hettelah avaithumnae a kamnue hnukkhu, Cathut ma ni hote hno teh kalvan lah bout a tawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Piter ni a hmu e vision hah bang ngainae vaimoe titeh kângairu lahun nah, Konilias ni a patoun e naw ni Simon im pacei laihoi a tawng awh teh longkha koehoi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Piter telah kaw e Simon hah hete im dawk a luen maw telah a pacei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Piter ni vision kong a pouk lahun nah Muitha ni tami kathum touh ni nang na tawng awh. Thaw nateh kum haw ahnimouh teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />kai ni ka patoun e doeh. Lung kâounnae awm laipalah kâbang lawih atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hatdawkvah Piter ni a kum teh na tawng awh e teh kai doeh. Bang panki lahoi maw na tho awh, atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahnimouh ni hettelah atipouh, ransabawi Kornilias ni na patoun awh e doeh. Ahni teh Cathut ka taket e hoi tami kahawi lah ao teh Judah taminaw ni a baripoung e doeh. Ahni ni na lawk a thai panuek nahan Cathut e kalvantami buet touh ni nang hah coun loe atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Piter ni taminaw teh imthungkhu kâen awh atipouh teh hote tangmin teh hawvah a roe awh. A tangtho a kârasoup awh teh ahnimouh koe a cei. Joppa kho e hmaunawngha a tangawn hai a cei van.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tawkkahnin Kaisarea a pha awh teh hawvah Kornilias hoi avaica a huikonaw a coun e naw ni a ring awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Piter a kâen tahma Konilias ni a dawn teh a hmalah a tabo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Piter ni kangdout atipouh, kai hai tami van doeh atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Piter ni Konilias pato laihoi imthungkhu a kâen nah, tami moikapap a kamkhueng e hah a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ahnimouh koe, Judahnaw teh Jentelnaw hoi kamyawng phung nahoeh, ahnimouh koe kahlawng hai cei phung na hoeh tie nangmouh ni kacaicalah na panue awh. Hateiteh tami bang patet hai kakhin hoi kathoung hoeh lah ka pouk hoeh nahan Cathut ni na patue toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hatdawkvah na kaw awh navah banghai oun han awm laipalah ka tho. Hatdawkvah bangkongmaw na kaw awh, dei a haw telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Konilias ni hettelah ati. Atu totouh rawca ka hai, suimilam kathum nah im vah ka ratoum. Atu hnin pali a pha toe. Hnipangaw a kâkhu teh kaie hmalah a kangdue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Kornilias na ratoum pawlawk kai ni ka thai toe. Nange poehnonaw haiyah Cathut hmalah pahnim hoeh hanelah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hatdawkvah Joppa kho kaawm Piter tie Simon hah kaw hanlah patoun leih. Tuipui teng phaivuen thaw ka tawk e Simon im doeh a luen. Ahni a tho torei teh nang koe a dei han doeh na ti pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hatdawkvah kai ni nang koevah tami tang ka patoun. Tang na tho thai dawk ka lung hroung ahawi. Atu kaimanaw pueng ni nang koe Cathut ni a dei e thai thai hanelah na hmalah ka o awh telah Kornilias ni a dei pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hatnavah Piter ni a kâko a paawng teh, lawkkatang lah Cathut teh tami minhmai khen hoeh ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Alouklouk e taminaw hai Cathut taki laihoi thaw kathoungrouk lah ka tawk e tami teh minhmai kahawi a hmu tie kai ni ka panue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tami pueng e Cathut ni Jisuh Khrih lahoi roumnae kamthang kahawi a dei e hah, Isarel miphunnaw koe poe e lawk nangmouh ni na panue awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Jawhan teh baptisma kong hah a dei hnukkhu Galilee ram hoi a kamtawng teh, Judah ram hmuen tangkuem dawk kaawm e hnonaw nangmouh ni na panue awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Cathut ni Kathoung Muitha e bahu hoi Nazareth tami Jisuh hah satui a awi. Ahni teh Cathut e kâ lahoi hnokahawi a sak teh kahraimathout ni a rektap e naw damnae a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Kaimouh haiyah, Jerusalem kho hoi kamtawng teh, Judah ram thung a sak e hnonaw hah kapanuekkhaikung lah ka o awh. Hote tami teh, thingpalam dawk a pathout awh teh a thei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Apâthum hnin Cathut ni bout a thaw sak teh tak kamnuenae kâ a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tami pueng koe koung kamnuek pouh hoeh. Cathut ni a rawi tangcoung e kapanuekkhaikung kaimouh koe a kamnue, duenae koehoi bout a thaw hnukkhu, hote Bawipa hoi kaimouh teh rei ka canei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Hote Bawipa ni kahringnaw hoi kadoutnaw lawkcengkung lah, Cathut ni a rawi e lah ao tie tami pueng koe dei pouh hane hoi kampangkhai hanelah kaimouh koe kâ na poe awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Hote Bawipa ka yuem e pueng a min lahoi lungmanae lahoi yonthanae a coe awh han telah profetnaw pueng teh hote Bawipa kapanuekkhaikung lah ka o awh telah Piter ni a dei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Hote lawk a dei lahun navah ka thai pueng koe Kathoung Muitha teh a pha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Jentel miphunnaw ni Kathoung Muitha e lungmanae a coe awh dawk, vuensom ka a e, Piter hoi a hnukkâbangnaw a kângairu awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, ahnimouh ni alouklouk lae lawk lahoi Cathut a pholen awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Hathnukkhu Piter ni kaimouh patetlah Kathoung Muitha ka coe e hetnaw heh baptisma poe sak hoeh hanlah apipatet maw na ka ngang thai han ati hnukkhu
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Jisuh Khrih e min lahoi baptisma coe sak hanlah kâ a poe. Hathnukkhu teh Piter hah ahnimanaw ni atueng ka saw hnawn lah okhai hane a kâhei awh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah ram thung kaawm e gunceinaw hoi hmaunawnghanaw ni Jentelnaw ni Cathut lawk a dâw awh toe tie a thai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hahoi teh Piter ni Jerusalem kho a pha toteh vuensom ka a naw ni ahni teh a pathoe awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nangmanaw vuensom ka a hoeh e naw koe na kâen awh teh na canei awh telah yon a hnei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hahoi teh Piter ni hote a konglamnaw kahawicalah buet touh hnukkhu buet touh a dei pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Joppa kho ka ratoum navah vision ka hmu. Hni kalenpui buet touh a takin pali touh kaawm e kalvan lahoi kabawt e ka hmu teh ka teng vah a pha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Athung vah kahawicalah ka khet teh talai van e a khok pali touh e moithangnaw, sarangnaw, a vawn hoi kâva e naw hoi tavanaw hah ka hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hahoi lawk buet touh ka thai. Piter thaw nateh, thet haw, hahoi teh cat loe, na ti pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hatei, kai ni coung thai mahoeh Bawipa, bangkongtetpawiteh, kathounghoehe hno teh ka kâko dawk kâen boihoeh ka ti pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hatnavah apâhni lah kalvan hoi e a lawk teh Cathut ni a thoungsak e nang ni thoung hoeh tet hanh a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hettelah vai thum touh thung ati hnukkhu hotnaw pueng teh kalvan lah bout a tawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hat navah, Kaisarea kho lahoi kai koe a patoun e tami kathum touh kai ka onae im hmalah a kangdue awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hatnavah Kathoung Muitha ni oupvoutnae awm laipalah ahnimouh hoi rei cet lawih telah na ti pouh. Hete hmaunawngha taruk touh hai kai hoi rei a cei awh teh kaimouh teh ahni im ka kâen awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hote tami ni kalvantami ni ahnie imthungkhu a kangdue teh Joppa kho lah tami patoun nateh Piter tie Simon hah kaw loe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahni ni nangmouh imthungkhu abuemlah rungngang lah na o awh nahanlah a hmu e hah na dei pouh han ti teh a hmu e hah kaimouh koe a dei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hahoi teh tang ka dei teh, Kathoung Muitha teh ahmaloe maimae lathueng a pha e patetlah ahnimouh lathueng hai a pha van.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hatnavah Jawhan ni tui baptisma a poe. Nangmouh teh Kathoung Muitha dawk baptisma na hmu awh han telah Bawipa ni a dei e lawn ka pouk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hat torei teh, Cathut ni Bawipa Jisuh Khrih ka yuem e nangmouh na poe e poehno patetlah, ahnimouh haiyah a poe van dawkvah, bangtelah vai khuet ka rakhout thai toung va telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahnimouh teh hote lawk a thai navah sairasuepcalah ao awh. Hathnukkhu Cathut a pholen awh teh Cathut ni hringnae dawk pha sak lah kaawm e pankângainae phunglawk hah Jentelnaw koe haiyah a poe toe titeh a dei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Stiven rektap kecu dawk kâkapek awh e naw teh, Phoenicia ram koehoi saipras tuilum hoi Antiok kho totouh a cei awh. Ahnimouh teh Judah miphun dei laipalah, api koehai kamthang lawk teh dei awh hoeh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hatei, Saipras hoi Grik kho e tami a tangawn ahnimouh koe a bawk teh Antiok kho a cei awh. Grik lawk ka dei e Judahnaw koe haiyah a dei pouh teh Bawipa Jisuh e kamthang kahawi teh a dei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bawipa e thaonae kut teh ahnimouh hoi rei ao dawkvah, tami moikapap ni a yuem awh teh Bawipa koe a kâthung awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahnimae kamthang teh Jerusalem kaawm e kawhmoun ni a thai navah, Barnabas hah Antiok kho cei hanlah a patoun awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Barnabas a pha teh, Cathut e lungmanae a hmu torei teh a lunghawi, ahnimanaw hanlah yuemnae lahoi Bawipa koe pou kâhnai hanelah tha a poe teh a hroecoe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, ahni teh tami kahawilah ao dawkvah, Kathoung Muitha hoi thoseh, yuemnae hoi thoseh, kakawi e lah ao. Hatnavah tami moikapap Bawipa dawk a kâthung awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Barnabas teh Tarshish kho a cei teh, Sawl hah a tawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A kâhmo toteh Antiok khovah a thokhai teh kum touh thung kawhmoun hoi a kamkhueng awh teh tami moikapap a cangkhai awh. Antiok khovah ahnukkâbangnaw hah Khristennaw telah hmaloe a kaw awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hatnae tueng dawkvah Jerusalem hoi Antiok khovah profetnaw a cei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ahnimouh thung dawkvah Agabus tie ni a kangdue teh, talaivan pueng dawkvah takang kalenpounge a tho han telah muitha lahoi a pâpho. Hote takang teh Kalawdias siangpahrang a tawk nah a tho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hatnavah a hnukkâbangnaw ni a tithai awh e patetlah kabawp hanelah lengkaleng a tâcokhai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ahnimouh ni hottelah a tâcokhai e hah Barnabas hoi Sawl koehoi patuen kacuenaw koe a patawn awh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hatnae tueng nah Herod siangpahrang ni kawhmoun thungvah tami tangawn rektap hanelah a man awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahni ni Jawhan e hmau Jem hah tahloi hoi a thei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hettelah a thei nah Judahnaw a lunghawi awh tie a hmu dawkvah Piter hai man hanlah bout a kâcai. Hatnae tueng teh tonphuenhoehe vaiyei pawi lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Herod ni Piter a man hoi thongim thung a pakhum teh ka ring hanelah ransa phu touh dawk pali touh kaawm e, phu pali touh koe a poe. Ahni ni ceitakhai pawi a baw toteh tamimaya hmalah a tâcokhai han a ngainae ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hettelah hoi Piter teh thongim thung a paung awh. Hatnavah kawhmoun ni Piter hanlah Cathut koe puenghoi a ratoum pouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Herod ni tamimaya hmalah a tâcokhai nahane hnin a pha hoehnahlan tangmin vah Piter hah sumbawtarui kahni touh hoi a pakhi awh teh ransa roi e rahak a i sak awh. Ka ring e naw ni hai takhang koe king a ring awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hatnavah Cathut e kalvantami a tho teh thongim thung pheng a ang. Kalvantami ni Piter e a na koe a tek pouh teh, karang thaw leih atipouh. Hat nah tahma vah sumbawtaruinaw ahni kut dawk hoi pak a ca pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kalvantami ni, taisawm kâyeng nateh khokkhawm khawm leih atipouh e patetlah Piter ni a kâroe. Hahoi, hni kâkhu nateh ka hnuk kâbang, bout atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Piter ni a thaw teh ahnie a hnuk a kâbang. Hatei kalvantami ni ati e hah kantak nahoeh mue, vision mue ka hmu a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thongim karingkungnaw ni, ringnae apasueke hoi apâhni e hmuen a tapoung teh kho thung kâennae sum longkha koe a pha roi. Hote longkha hai a mahmawk a kamawng teh hote hmuen koehoi a tâco roi. Hahoi lamthung buet touh dawk a cei navah, kalvantami ni Piter teh a ceitakhai .
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hatnavah Piter a lungcai teh, Bawipa ni a kalvantami a patoun teh, Herod bawi e kut dawk hoi Judahnaw ni a sak e naw thung hoi, kai hah na hlout sak katang e ka panue telah a dei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hote hno kaawm e a lungcai katang hoiyah Mark ati awh e Jawhan e a manu Meri im lah a cei. Hote im dawk taminaw a kamkhueng awh teh a ratoum awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Piter ni takhang tho a takhawng pouh nah Rhoda tie sannu ni tho paawng hanlah a cei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Piter e a lawk tie a nout navah, tho paawng pouh laipalah lunghawinae lahoi im thung lah a yawng teh, tho koe Piter a kangdue, tie a dei pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahnimouh ni, na pathu maw atipouh awh. Hatei napui ca ni a tang doeh telah makkhak a dei. Hatdawkvah ahnimouh ni yah, ahnie a kalvantami vai aw, atipouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hatnavah Piter ni tho a takhawng. Ahnimouh ni a paawng teh a hmu navah a kângairu awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sairasuep lah awm awh telah a kut hoi a kamnue sak. Bawipa ni bangtelah hoi maw thongim thung hoi na tâco sak tie a dei pouh. Hete konglamnaw hah, Jem hoi hmaunawnghanaw koehai dei pouh awh atipouh teh alouklah a ceitakhai .
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amom khodai toteh, Piter heh bangne ka tet ati awh teh ransanaw teh ruengrueng ati awh e heh kathoenge nahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Herod ni tawng awh atipouh. Hatei hmawt awh hoeh. Karingkungnaw pacei nateh thet awh telah kâ a poe. Hathnukkhu vah Herod teh Judah ram hoi Kaisarea kho lah a cei teh hawvah dawngdeng ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Herod teh Taire hoi Sidon taminaw koevah, puenghoi a lungphuen dawkvah, ahnimanaw ni Herod koe a tho awh teh, Herod ka ring e Blastus hah kâmaihawikhai hanelah a dei pouh awh. Bangkongtetpawiteh ahnimae ram teh siangpahrang e ram thung hoi canei ka hmawt e lah ao awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahnimouh kamkhueng hnin vah Herod teh ama Siangpahrang e a puengcang kâmahrawk teh a bawitungkhung dawkvah a tahung teh tamimaya koe lawk a dei pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kamkhueng e taminaw ni, Lawk kadeikung heh tami kahring e lawk nahoeh cathut e lawk doeh titeh a hram awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Herod ni Cathut hah a bari hoeh dawkvah Bawipa e kalvantami ni vai touh lahoi a hem. Ahni teh pâri ni a ca teh a due.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Cathut lawk teh a kampai teh hoe a kamphung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Barnabas hoi Sawl ni kabawpnae thaw a cum roi hnukkhu Mark tie Jawhan hai a hrawi roi teh Jerusalem hoi bout a ban awh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Antiok kho kaawm e kawhmoun dawkvah Barnabas, Niger telah kaw e Simeon, Sairen tami Lusius, Herod bawi e a hui Manean, Sawl tinaw, profetnaw hoi kacangkhaikungnaw teh ao awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahnimouh ni rawca hai lahoi Bawipa a bawk awh navah Kathoung Muitha ni Barnabas hoi Sawl heh kai ni ka hmoun pouh e thaw tawk hanelah na takhoe pouh awh telah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hatnavah ahnimouh ni rawcahai ratoum hnukkhu ahnimouh roi e lathueng kut a toung awh teh a patoun awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hahoi, ahnimouh teh Kathoung Muitha ni a patoun awh e patetlah Seleukia kho lavah a cei awh teh Saipras lah long hoi a cei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Salamis kho a pha awh navah, Judahnaw e sinakoknaw dawkvah Cathut lawk hah a pâpho awh. Ahnimouh ni kabawmkung lah Jawhan hai a hrawi awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hote tuilum pet a kâhei hnukkhu Paphos kho totouh a pha awh navah camkathoum e profet kaphawk Barjisuh a kâhmo awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahni teh, hote tuilum ka uk e bawi Sergius tie teh Pawlus e a hui lah ao. Khobawi ni Cathut lawk thai hanelah puenghoi a ngai dawkvah Barnabas hoi Sawl teh a kaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hatei camkathoum e Elymas ni khobawi hah yuemnae koehoi phen sak hanelah a panki teh Barnabas hoi Sawl teh a ngang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hatnavah Pawl telah kaw e Sawl teh Kathoung Muitha hoi akawi dawkvah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />hote tami heh khei a khet teh, dumyennae hoi kakawi e kahraimathout capa, lannae taran lah kaawm e nang teh Cathut e lannae lamthung heh raphoe laipalah na awm thai hoeh maw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khenhaw! Cathut kut teh na tak dawk atu a pha toung dawkvah, na mit dawn vaiteh kho hmawt laipalah hnintha kasawlah na o han atipouh. Hat nah tahma vah, a mit amom teh kho lah a hmo pouh dawkvah ka hrawi hane tami vaivai a payam laihoi a tawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hote khobawi ni a hmu navah Bawipa hoi kâkuen e cangkhai e naw hah kângairu lahoi a pholen teh a yuem.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pawl hoi a huinaw teh Paphos kho hoi long hoi a cei awh teh Pamfilia ram Perga khovah a pha awh. Hatnavah Jawhan teh ahnimouh hoi a kamphei teh Jerusalem kho lah a ban.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahnimanaw teh Perga kho hoi bout a cei awh teh, Pisidia ram Antiok kho a pha awh. Sabbath hnin vah sinakok thung a kâen awh teh a tahung awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kâlawk cauknaw hoi profet cauknaw a touk awh navah, sinakok kaukkungnaw ni tami a patoun teh, ka hmaunawnghanaw tamimaya thapoelawk dei han awm pawiteh dei awh loe telah atipouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hatnavah, Pawl ni a thaw teh, kut a dâw hnukkhu Isarel miphunnaw hoi Cathut ka taket e naw ka lawk thai awh haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Isarel miphunnaw Cathut ni maimae mintoenaw hah a rawi teh Izip ram san lah ao awh navah miphun kalenpoung lah a coung sak teh, a kut thakaawmpounge hoi ahnimouh teh hote ram thung hoi a tâco sak toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kum 40 touh thung thingyei yon dawk a khetyawt.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hahoi, Kanaan ram kaawm e miphun phun sari touh e naw hah a raphoe teh ahnimae ram dawk a taminaw hah râw a rei awh teh ao sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hatteh, kum 450 touh a ro. Hahoi, profet Samuel se totouh lawkcengkungnaw a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahnimouh ni siangpahrang a hei awh navah Cathut ni Benjamin miphun lah kaawm e Kish capa Sawl teh kum 40 touh thung siangpahrang hanelah a poe awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hahoi ahni hah a takhoe teh, Isarel siangpahrang lah Devit hah a tawm pouh. Ahni hah a kampangkhai teh hettelah a dei, ka lung ka youk ni teh kaie ngainae ka kuep sak hane tami Jesi capa Devit ka hmu toe, telah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cathut lawkkam patetlah Isarelnaw hane rungngangkung Jisuh teh Devit catoun dawk hoi a tâco sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hote Bawipa a tho hoehnahlan vah Jawhan ni Isarelnaw pueng koe pankângainae baptisma kong sut a pâpho toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jawhan teh a tawk e thaw a cum tawmlei nah, nangmouh ni kai hah api lah maw na pouk awh vaw. Kai teh ka tho hane Bawipa nahoeh. Ahni teh ka hnuklah doeh a tho. Ahni khok dawk e khokkhawm rui patenghai rasu pouh hanlah kai kamcu hoeh a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Abraham catoun lah kaawm e naw hoi nangmouh thung e Cathut ka bari e hmaunawnghanaw, hete rungngangnae kamthang kahawi teh kaimouh koe poe lah ao toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Jerusalem e taminaw hoi kacue e naw ni, hote Bawipa hoi Sabbath hnintangkuem touk lah kaawm e profet lawknaw hai a thai panuek awh hoeh dawkvah, hote Bawipa hah a theinae lahoi profet lawknaw teh a kuep sak awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ahnimouh ni Bawipa hah thei thai nahane yon a tawng a ei a hmu awh hoeh nahlangva vah thei hanelah Pailat Bawi koe a hei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hottelah hoiyah Bawipa noe lahoi thut lah kaawm e pueng a kuep sak awh hnukkhu, a ro hah thing dawk hoi a rasu awh teh, tangkom dawk a pakawp awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hatei, Cathut ni Bawipa teh duenae koehoi a thaw sak toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Bawipa teh Galilee hoi Jerusalem totouh kahlawng lah a cei navah, amae a hnukkâbangnaw koe hnin moikapap a kamnue pouh. Ahnimouh teh, Bawipa kapanuekkhaikung lah ao awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Atuvah, hete lunghawinae kamthang teh nangmouh koe a pha thai nahanlah hi ka tho e doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Cathut ni Jisuh hah a thaw sak teh, mintoenaw e catoun lah kaawm e maimouh han lah, hote lawkkam hah a kuep sak toe. Het hateh apâhni e Sam dawk nang teh kaie Ka Capa lah na o. Sahnin vah nang hah na khe sak toe, telah a thut tangcoung e patetlah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Duenae koehoi bout a thaw nahane kong hoi rawknae dawk bout pha hoe nahanelah Cathut ni a dei e teh, kathounge hoi yuemkamcu e yawhawinae Devit koe lawk ka kam tangcoung e hah nangmouh koe na poe awh han tie hah doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hatdawkvah alouke Sam la dawk hai Bawipa hanlah houk kathounge naw teh bout pawk sak mahoeh toe telah bout a dei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Devit ni amae tueng dawk Cathut thaw a tawk teh a due hnukkhu, mintoenaw e phuen thung pakawp teh pawknae koe a pha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Hateiteh Cathut ni thaw sak lah kaawm e Bawipa teh pawk hoeh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Hatdawkvah ka hmaunawnghanaw, hote Bawipa lahoi yon ngaithoumnae kamthang nangmouh koe pâpho e hah, ka yuem pueng ni Mosi e kâlawk lahoi lan sak thai hoeh e thung hoi na lan sak toe tie panuek awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hote Bawipa lahoi na lan toe telah khoe lah onae nakunghai, nangmouh ni panuek awh haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, ayâ ka pacekpahlek e naw, khen awh, kângairu awh nateh, rawknae koe phat awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh kai ni nangmae se dawk hno buet touh ka sak han. Tami buetbuet touh ni hote hno hah nangmouh koe pheng ka pâpho nakunghai, nangmouh ni khoeroe na yuem a mahoeh telah profetnaw hno lahoi dei tangcoung e teh, nangmouh koe a bo hoeh nahanlah kâhruetcuet awh atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Pawl hoi Silas a ban roi navah hmalae sabbath hnin haiyah hete kamthang bout dei pouh hanelah Jentelnaw ni a kâhei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Sinakok hoi a tâco awh hnukkhu vah, Judahnaw hoi Judah phung lah kâen ni teh Cathut ka bawk e naw ni Pawl hoi Barnabas hnuk a kâbang awh. Cathut lungmanae dawk pou awm a loe telah ahnimouh roi ni tha a poe roi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Hmalae sabbath hnin dawk teh lawkkatang thai hanelah khobuem a kamkhueng awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Hatei, Judahnaw ni hote tamihupui hah a hmu awh navah, a ut awh teh Pawl ni a dei e hoi kâtaran lah dudamnae lawk a dei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Hatnavah Pawl hoi Barnabas ni lungtang laihoi a dei roi e teh, Cathut e lawkkatang hah nangmouh koe hmaloe pâpho han ka ngai ei teh nangmouh teh a yungyoe hringnae na hmu awh nahanlah na kamcu awh hoeh dawkvah, Jentelnaw koe lah ka kamlang awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, Bawipa ni, nangmouh teh rungngangnae hah talai pout totouh pâpho hanelah, kai ni nangmanaw teh Jentelnaw e angnae lah na ta awh toe telah kaimouh koe kâ na poe toe atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Jentelnaw ni hote lawk a thai awh navah, a lunghawi awh teh, Bawipa e lawk hah a bawilen sak awh. Yungyoe hringnae coe hanelah hmoun tangcoung e tami pueng nihaiyah a yuem awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Hettelah hoi Bawipa e a lawkkatang teh haw e khoram pueng dawk a kamthang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Hatei, Judahnaw niyah Cathut ka bawk ni teh bari kaawm e napuinaw hoi khobawinaw hah a hroecoe awh teh Pawl hoi Barnabas hah rektap sak hanelah a tacuek awh. Ahnimouh roi hah amamae kho dawk hoi a pâlei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Hattoteh Pawl hoi Barnabas ni a khok dawk e vaiphu a takhawng sin teh Ikonium kho lah a cei roi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />A hnukkâbangnaw hai lunghawinae hoi thoseh, Kathoung Muitha hoi thoseh, akawi awh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pawl hoi Barnabas ni lkonium kho Judah miphunnaw e sinakok vah a kâen roi teh, a pâpho roi navah, Judah miphunnaw hoi Grik miphunnaw tami moikapap ni a yuem awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hatei ka yuem hoeh e Judah miphunnaw niyah Jentelnaw hah a tacuek awh teh a hmaunawngha rahak kâpohoehnae a tâco sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hatdawkvah ahnimouh roi ni moi kasawlah ao sin roi teh Cathut e lawkkatang hah taranhawi laihoi a kampangkhai roi. Bawipa ni hai ahnimouh roi e kut dawk hoi mitnoutnaw hoi kângairu hnonaw hah sak thainae kâ a poe teh, amae lungmanae lawkkatang koe lah a kampangkhai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kho thung e taminaw teh kahni touh lah a kâkapek awh. Atangawn teh Judahnaw koelah a tangawn teh gunceinaw koe lah a kampang awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jentelnaw hoi Judahnaw ni amamae khobawinaw hoi cungtalah gunceinaw hah rektap vaiteh talung hoi ka dout lah dêi han ati awh e hah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gunceinaw ni a panue awh toteh, Likonia ram kaawm e Listra hoi ‘Derbi kho tengpam vah koung a yawng awh teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />haw e hmuen koe kamthang kahawi a pâpho awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Listra khovah kaawm e, a manu vawn thung hoi vai touh hai ka cet boihoeh e khokkhem tami buet touh teh Pawl ni a dei e lawk a thai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pawl ni a khet teh yuemnae a tawn e, a hmu navah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />thaw nateh kangdout haw telah kacaipounglah a dei pouh teh hluet a thaw teh a cei thai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pawl ni a sak e hno a hmu awh navah ‘Ikonia lawk hoi a dei awh e teh cathutnaw heh tami lah a kâsak teh maimouh koe a kum ati awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahnimouh ni Barnabas hah Zeus ati awh teh, Pawl heh phung kadeikung hoi kahrawikung lah ao dawkvah, Hermes atipouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Vaihma Zeus e bawkim teh kho alawilah ao teh, tamimaya hoi thuengnae sak hanelah a ngai awh dawkvah, maitotannaw hoi a peinaw hah kho thung a kâenkhai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Guncei Barnabas hoi Pawl ni hottelah ati awh e a thai navah amamae khohna a ravei teh taminaw e rahak a kâen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Barnabas hoi Pawl ni hei nangmanaw bangdawkmaw hettelah na sak awh. Kaimouh hai nangmouh patetlah talai dawk kho ka sak awh van e nahoehmaw. Nangmouh ni het patet e ayawmyin hno na sak awh e hah cettakhai awh. Kalvan, talai, tuipui hoi a cawngca kasakkung kahring Cathut dawk na lungkâthung awh nahanlah kaimouh teh kamthang kahawi ka dei e doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Yo kaloum e senaw dawkvah, Cathut ni taminaw pueng hah amamae lamthung a dawn thai nahan pak a hnoun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hatei nangmouh koe hnokahawi a sak e, canei kakhoutcalah a poe teh a lunghawi sak nahanlah, kalvan hoi kho a rak sak teh, atimunaw a paw sak. Ratui ahawi sak teh Bawipa hawinae kampangkhai laipalah kaawm thai awh hoeh telah Pawl hoi Barnabas ni a hramkikhai roi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahnimouh roi ni hottelah a hramkhai roi dawkvah thuengnae sak hoeh nahanlah rangpuinaw hah puenghoi a cakâ thai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hathnukkhu Antiok kho hoi Ikonium kho lahoi Judah miphunnaw teh a tho awh teh rangpuinaw pueng a pâkhueng awh teh Pawl hah talung hoi a dêi awh. A due toe ati awh teh kho alawilah a sawn awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hatei a hnukkâbangnaw ni a khet lahun nah Pawl bout a thaw teh kho thung bout a kâen. A tangtho vah Pawl teh Barnabas hoi Derbi kho lah a cei toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahnimanaw ni hote kho dawkvah, kamthang kahawi a dei awh teh tami moikapap ni a hnukkâbang lah a coung awh. Hahoi teh Listra lah a ban awh teh, lkonium hoi Pisidia ram Antiok kho lah a cei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Yuemnae dawk kacaklah kangdout awh telah tha a poe hnukkhu, maimanaw teh Cathut uknaeram dawk kâen nahanlah rucatnae moi khang awh han telah a dei pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kawhmoun tangkuem dawk hai kacuenaw a rawi pouh teh, rawcahai laihoi a ratoum awh hnukkhu, amamouh ni a yuem awh e Bawipa e kut dawk ahnimanaw hah a hnawng awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hahoi teh Pawl hoi Barnabas teh Pisidia ram a tapoung roi teh Pamfilia ram lah a pha roi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Perga kho lawk a pâpho hnukkhu Attalia kho lah a cei roi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hote kho koehoi atu e a tawk awh e thaw a cum awh nahanelah a patounnae Antiok kho lah long hoi bout a cei roi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hawvah a pha toteh, kawhmoun hah a kamkhueng sak teh, ahnimouh roi hno lahoi Cathut ni a sak e hno hoi Jentelnaw koe yuemnae takhang a kamawngnae hah a dei pouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hathnukkhu haw vah hnukkâbangnaw koe hnin moi kasawlah ao awh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tami bangpatetnaw ni Judah ram lahoi a tho awh teh, Mosi e kâlawk patetlah vuensomanae ka hmawt hoeh e ni rungngang lah na awm thai mahoeh, telah hmaunawnghanaw a cangkhai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hatnavah Pawl, Barnabas ti hoi ahnimanaw teh kâounnae puenghoi ao dawkvah, hmaunawnghanaw ni, Pawl, Barnabas hoi alouke a hnukkâbangnaw hoiyah hote laidei hanelah Jerusalem kaawm e gunceinaw hoi kacuenaw koe a cei awh hane lawk a dei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kawhmoun ni ahnimanaw yo a thak awh. Phoenicia hoi Samaria ram lahoi pou a cei awh navah, Jentelnaw koe a lungpatawnae kong ahnimouh ni a dei awh teh hmaunawnghanaw pueng a lunghawi sak awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jerusalem a pha awh navah, kawhmoun hoi Gunceinaw, kacuenaw ni a dawn awh. Ahnimouh ni Cathut ni ahnimouh hno lahoi hno a sak e naw a dei pouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hatei Farasinaw koe lahoi ka yuem e tami tangawn ni a kangdue awh teh, Jentelnaw hah vuensoma sak hane hoi Mosi e kâlawk tarawi sak hanelah lawkthui hanelah ao ati awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hatdawkvah gunceinaw hoi kacuenaw ni hote lawk paceinae pouk hanelah a kamkhueng awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tha hoi a kâoun awh hnukkhu vah Piter ni a kangdue teh hmaunawnghanaw, Jentelnaw ni kamthang kahawi a thai awh teh, a yuem awh thai nahanlah Cathut ni nangmouh thung hoi kai heh kadeikung lah na rawi e na panue awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lungthin be ka panuek e Cathut ni Kathoung Muitha heh maimouh na poe e patetlah ahnimouh hai a poe awh teh ahnimouh koelah a kampangkhai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cathut ni ahnimouh hoi maimouh khoeroe kapeknae awm laipalah yuemnae lahoi ahnimae lungthin a thoungsak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hatdawkvah nangmouh ni mintoenaw hoi maimouh ni hai phu thai hoeh e hno teh ahnimae a loung dawk na patue e lahoi atuvah Cathut tanouk hanlah na ngai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Maimouh hai ahnimouh patetlah Bawipa Jisuh Khrih e a lungmanae kecu dawk rungngang lah o teh yuem awh, atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hatnavah ka kamkhueng e tami pueng teh sairasuep lah ao awh teh, Barnabas hoi Pawl ti ni ahnimouh koehoi Jentelnaw koe Cathut ni a sak e mitnoutnae hoi kângairunae a dei awh e a thai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahnimanaw ni lawk dei e a pâbaw awh hnukkhu, Jem ni hmaunawnghanaw, kaie ka lawk thai awh haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cathut ni ama hanlah Jentelnaw thung hoi a miphun lah a coe nahan, ahnimouh koe hmaloe a thonae hah Simeon ni apasuek vah a dei toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Profetnaw e a lawk dei e hai hete a lawk hoi a kâvan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cakathoung ni, hetnaw e hnuklah kai ni bout ka tho vaiteh ka rawm tangcoung e Devit e lukkareiim hah bout ka sak han. Raphoe tangcoung e hote rim hah bout sak lah ao vaiteh ka caksak han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka min lahoi ka kaw e Jentelnaw hai a yungyoe ka hring e Cathut a tawng awh nahane doeh telah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />ayan hoi hete lawk ka panueksakkung Bawipa ni a dei atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hatdawkvah Jentelnaw koehoi Cathut koe lah a lungkâthung e naw koe runae poe hanlah awmhoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Meikaphawk dawk thounghoehnae, kamsoumhoehe napui tongpa yonnae, lahuen kara e moi hoi a thinaw hah roun hanelah ahnimouh koe ca lahoi thaisak hanlah ka pouk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh ayan hoi kho tangkuem vah Mosi e phung lawk ka dei e ao teh, hote lawk hah sabbath hnintangkuem sinakoknaw dawk ouk touk awh atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hatnavah Gunceinaw, kacuenaw hoi Kawhmoun abuemlah ni amamouh thung dawk e tami a rawi awh teh, Pawl, Barnabas hoi hmaunawnghanaw thung dawk e kahrawikung lah kaawm awh e Barsabbas telah a kaw awh e Judah hoi Silas a rawi awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahnimouh koe a sin sak awh e ca dawkvah, gunceinaw kacuenaw hoi hmaunawnghanaw ni Antiok kho Siria ram hoi Cilicia ram kaawm e Jentel hmaunawnghanaw kut na man awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kaimouh koe e tami bangpatet ni kaimouh ni patoun laipalah a cei awh teh lawk aphunphun lah a dei awh teh, nangmouh na lungpuen awh teh, a rucatnae na poe awh tie ka thai awh. Vuensom na a awh vaiteh, kâlawk hai na tarawi awh roeroe han a ti awh. Hotpatetlae lawk dei hanelah ahnimouh koe kâpoelawk banghai ka poe awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hatdawkvah kaimouh ni ka kâhmo awh teh, maimouh ni pahren e Pawl hoi Barnabas hoi cungtalah nangmouh koe tami patoun hanelah ka lung a kuep awh. Hatdawkvah maimouh ni Bawipa Jisuh Khrih min kecu dawkvah amamae hringnae kâphumnaw lah kaawm e,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />maimouh ni lungpataw awh e Barnabas hoi Pawl tinaw hoi reirei patoun hanelah tami kahni touh rawi hane ka lungkuep awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hatdawkvah Judas hoi Silas hah ka rawi awh teh nangmouh koe ka patoun awh. Ahnimouh ni lawk hoi hai a dei awh han doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hete phunglamnaw hloilah alouke hnokari titca hai nangmouh van toung sak hoeh nahanlah Kathoung Muitha hoi kaimouh ni ka hnâbo awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hote phunglam teh nangmouh ni meikaphawk bawknae hno, thi, lahuen kara e moi, hoi kamsoumhoehe napui tongpa yonnae hah roun awh. Nangmouh teh hete hnonaw hoi kathoung lah na awm awh pawiteh ahawi. Na tak dam awh naseh telah a thut pouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Gunceinaw a patoun navah Antiok kho lah a cei awh teh, haw a pha hoi kayuemnaw a pâkhueng awh hnukkhu ca hah ahnimae kut dawk a poe awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ahnimouh ni hote ca a touk awh teh thapoenae lawk dawk a konawm awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Judah hoi Silas amamouh roi hai profet lah ao roi dawkvah ahnimouh koe thapoenae lawk a dei pouh roi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ahnimanaw teh hnin dongdeng ao awh teh, hmaunawnghanaw ni lungmawng lah a thak awh teh kapatounkungnaw koe let a ban sak awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hatei Silas teh hawvah tongtang ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Pawl hoi Barnabas teh Antiok kho ao navah alouke taminaw hoi cungtalah Bawipa e lawk hah a cangkhai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A hnin moi ao hoi Pawl ni Barnabas koe, Bawipa e lawk pâpho tangcoungnae kho dawk kaawm e hmaunawnghanaw, bangtelane ao awh tie yo hloe hanelah ahnimouh koe bout cet awh sei atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Barnabas ni Mark tie Jawhan hai hrawi hanelah a ngai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Hateiteh, Pawl ni Pamfilia ram vah ahnimouh hoi a kamphei teh oun a cei dawkvah, a thaw tawknae koe ahnimouh hoi reirei ka cet ngai hoeh e teh kaw hanelah awmhoeh telah a pouk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hatnavah puenghoi kâounnae ao dawkvah buet touh hoi buet touh a kamphei roi toe. Barnabas ni Mark a hrawi teh Saipras tuilum lah a cei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Pawl ni Silas a rawi teh hmaunawnghanaw lahoi Bawipa e lungmanae dawk hnawng lah ao hnukkhu a kamthaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ahni teh Siria ram hoi Cilicia ram lah tawngtang a cei teh, kawhmounnaw hah a cak sak.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hathnukkhu hoi Pawl teh Derbi kho hoi Lustra kho a pha. Listra kho dawk Timote telah a min poe e a hnukkâbang buet touh ao. Ahnie a manu teh ka yuem e Judah tami napui buet touh doeh, a na pa teh Grik tami doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahni teh Listra lahoi, Ikonium kho dawk kaawm e hmaunawnghanaw thung bari kamcu e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pawl ni Timote hrawi hanelah a ngai. Ahnie a na pa Jentel tami tie hote hmuen koe kaawm e Judah tami pueng ni a panue awh dawk vuensom a a pouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahnimouh teh khopuinaw koe yuengyoe a cei awh navah, Jerusalem kho dawk kaawm e gunceinaw hoi pastornaw lawk a poe e naw hah kayuemnaw tarawi hanelah a poe awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hottelah kawhmounnaw teh yuemnae dawk kacaklah ao teh, hnin touh hnukkhu hnin touh a pung awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Frigia ram, Galati ram lah a cei awh hnukkhu Asia ram dawk lawkkatang hah dei hoeh hanelah Kathoung Muitha ni a ngang dawkvah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Misia ram lah a pha awh teh, Bitunia ram lah cei han ati awh navah, Muitha ni kâ a poe hoeh dawkvah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Misia ram a tengpam a cei awh teh, Troas kho a pha awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tangmin vah Pawl koe vision a kamnue. Masidonia tami buet touh ni a kangdue teh, Masidonia ram lah raka nateh, kaimouh na kabawm haw telah a kâhei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hote vision a hmu nah, Masidonia ram dawk kamthang kahawi dei sak hanelah Bawipa ni kaimouh na kaw awh toe telah hnâ ka bo awh teh, hote ram koe lah cei hanelah tang ka kâcai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, Troas kho hoi long hoi ka cei awh teh Samotaret tuilum koe lah kuekluek ka cei awh teh, a tangtho vah Neapolis khovah ka pha awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hote kho dawk hoi bout ka tâco awh teh Masidonia ram thung kaawm e Filippi khopui ka pha awh teh dongdeng hnin ka saw lah ka o awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sabbath hnin vah kaimouh kho alawilah ka tâco awh teh ratoumnae hmuen ao han mue telah ka pouk awh teh tuipui rai lah ka cei awh. Hote hmuen koe ka tahung awh teh napuinaw hanlah ka dei pouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hatnavah hnipaling kâyawt e Tiatira kho e Lidia telah a kaw awh e napui, Cathut ka bawk e buet touh ao. Pawl ni a dei e phung lawk hah sairasuepcalah a thai nahan Cathut ni a lungthin tho a paawng pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hote napui teh a imthungkhunaw hoi Baptisma a coe hnukkhu, kai hah Bawipa koe yuemkamcu e tami lah na pouk awh pawiteh, kai im kâen nateh awm awh ei telah a kâhei teh kaimanaw koe na dei pouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hathnukkhu hoi kaimouh teh ratoumnae im koe ka cei awh navah hmalah han ka dei thai e, a thung kahrai kaawm e napui hoi ka kâhmo awh. Hote napui teh amae a bawipanaw hane ahawinae moi ka sak e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hote napui ca teh Pawl hoi kaimae hnuklah a kâbang teh ahnimouh teh kalenpounge Cathut e kamthang lawk rungngangnae lawk ka dei e doeh telah a hram.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hottelah, napuica ni a ngelawn dawkvah, Pawl ni a kamlang sin teh Jisuh Khrih min lahoi nang teh tâcawt telah kâ na poe. Hat nah tahma vah a thung hoi kahrai teh tang a tâco toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahnie bawinaw ni a bawireng thai nahanelah ngaihawinae awmhoeh toe tie a panue torei teh Pawl hoi Silas hah a man awh teh khobawinaw koe a thak awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Khobawinaw koe a pha roi toteh hetnaw hah Judah taminaw law pawiteh maimae khopui rucat a poe awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Rom tami lah kaawm e maimanaw ni yuem hoeh han e, tawk hoeh hane phunglawknaw a cangkhai awh telah ati awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kamkhueng e taminaw ni ahnimouh koe lah tang a kampangkhai awh teh Pawl hoi Silas hah a taran awh. Khobawinaw ni ahnimae angki a rading pouh teh ruitaboung hoi hem sak hanelah kâ a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A hem awh teh, hmâtan a ca awh. Kahawicalah ring awh telah thongim kaukkung koe kâ a poe teh thongim thung a paung awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hottelah lawkthui e patetlah thongim kaukkung ni thongim thung a paen teh a khok hlong a buet pouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Karumsaning Pawl hoi Silas teh Cathut koe ratoum laihoi Cathut a pholen roi. Thongim ka bawt e naw ni hai a thai pouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Pouk laipalah Tâlî puenghoi a no dawkvah thongim a kâhuet. Takhangnaw koung a kamawng. Thongkabawtnaw pâkhinae sumrui pueng pak a ca pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Thongim kaukkung a kâhlaw teh thongim takhangnaw a kamawng e a hmu navah thongim kamungnaw koung a yawng awh mue toe telah a pouk dawkvah tahloi hoi amahoima kâthei hanelah a kâcai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hatei Pawl niyah namahoima runae kâpoe hanh, kaimanaw hete hmuen koe be ka o awh telah kacaipounglah a dei pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hattoteh thongim a kaukkung ni hmaito hoi yawng laihoi a kâen teh Pawl hoi Silas e hmalah pâyaw laihoi a tabo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hathnukkhu ahnimouh roi alawilah a tâcokhai teh ka bawipa, rungngang lah o thai nahanlah bangmaw ka sak han ti teh a pacei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ahnimouh roi ni Bawipa Jisuh Khrih hah yuem haw. Hottelah na yuem pawiteh nama hoi na imthungnaw rungngang lah na o awh han atipouh roi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hathnukkhu ama hoi a imthungkhu dawk kaawm e naw pueng koe Bawipa e lawk hah a dei pouh roi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Thongim kaukkung ni hatnae tangmin vah ahnimanaw hah a hrawi teh, a hmâtannaw tâsi a hluk pouh. Hathnukkhu ama hoi a imthungkhu naw abuemlah baptisma koung a coe awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ahni ni Pawl hoi Silas hah ama im a kaw teh, rawca a pacapanei teh, imthung abuemlahoi Cathut a yuem awh dawkvah a konawm awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Khodai toteh khobawinaw ni, ram karingkungnaw a patoun teh, ahnimanaw hah tha awh leih atipouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Hatnavah thongim kaukkung ni hote kamthang hah Pawl koe a dei pouh. Khobawinaw ni tami a patoun awh teh, nangmanaw hah tha hanelah lawk na thui awh. Hatdawkvah, atu tâcawt awh nateh lungmawngcalah cet awh lawih atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Hatei Pawl ni ram ka ring e naw koe Rom tami lah kaawm e kaimanaw hah akungkhei laipalah taminaw hmalah na hem awh teh, thongim thung na paung awh hnukkhu, atu kaimanaw hah arulahoi maw na tha awh han vaw. Hottelah ti kawi na maw. Amamouh kuekluek tho awh naseh, kaimouh na rasat awh naseh atipouh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Hattoteh ram karingkungnaw ni hote lawknaw hah khobawinaw koe a dei pouh awh. Ahnimouh roi teh Rom tami roi doeh tie a panue awh torei teh, a taki awh dawkvah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />amamouh kuekluek a tho awh teh a kâhei awh. Hathnukkhu a tâco sak awh teh, hote kho thung hoi tâco hanelah a kâhei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ahnimouh hai thongim thung hoi a tâco awh toteh, Lidia im a cei awh teh, hmaunawnghanaw hoi a kâhmo awh. Ahnimouh thapoelawknaw a dei pouh hnukkhu alouklah a cei awh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hahoi teh Pawl hoi Silas teh Amphipolis kho hoi Apollonia kho a tapuet roi teh Thesalon kho a pha roi. Hote kho dawkvah Judahnaw e sinakok ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pawl ni ahmoun e patetlah ahnimanaw kamkhuengnae koe a cei teh Sabbath hnin hnin thum touh thung Cakathoung hah a kâdeikhai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khrih teh reithainae a khang vaiteh duenae koehoi bout a thaw han tie kamcengcalah a pâpho teh, nangmouh koe ka pâpho e hete Jisuh raw doeh Khrih toe atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahnimouh thung dawk a tangawn ni yuemnae dawk a pha teh, Pawl hoi Silas tinaw hnuk a kâbang awh. Cathut ka bawk e Griknaw moikapap hoiyah napui kam kamsawng e naw ni hai a yuem awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hatnavah Judahnaw ni a ut awh dawkvah tami kaponaw a kaw awh teh a pâkhueng awh. Khopui thung ruengruengti khai awh, Jason im hah khik a kalup awh teh, Pawl hoi Silas hah taminaw hmalah tâcokhai hanelah a tawng awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hatei ahnimouh roi teh a hmu awh hoeh dawkvah Jason hoi a hmaunawnghanaw hah, ukkungnaw koe a hrawi awh teh, kho tangkuem talaivan heh ka pakhuppathan e naw hi haiyah a pha awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jason ni ahnimouh ama im a luen sak. Ahnimanaw teh Sizar bawi hloilah alouke siangpahrang tie Jisuh ao ati awh teh, Sizar bawi hah a taran awh telah a hramki awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hote lawk ka thai e khobuem hoi ukkungnaw a lungpuen awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Jason hoi alouke hmaunawnghanaw koe e rawngkhannae tangka a la teh ahnimouh teh bout a tha awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pawl hoi Silas teh karum vah Berea kho a patoun awh. Hote kho dawk a pha roi toteh, Judahnaw e Sinakok vah a cei roi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Berea kho e taminaw teh, Thesalon kho e kaawm e naw hlak a talue awh. Pawl tinaw ni a dei e hah lungthocalah hoi a dâw awh teh, laithoe maw atang maw tie hah a panue thai awh nahanelah, Cakathoung hnintangkuem a touk awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahnimanaw thung dawk tami moikapap ni a yuem awh. Bari kaawm e Grik napuinaw hoi tongpanaw ni hai a yuem awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hateiteh Thesalon kho kaawm e Judah taminaw ni Pawl teh Berea kho hai Cathut lawk a dei tie hah a thai awh toteh, taminaw a tacuek awh teh, ruengrueng ati sak awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hatdawkvah hmaunawnghanaw ni Pawl hah karanglah tuipui totouh a thak awh. Silas hoi Timote teh hote khothung ao roi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pawl ka thak e naw ni Athen kho totouh a thak awh. Silas hoi Timote hah a coung thai nathung karanglah kai koe tho roi loe tie kâ a poe e a sin awh teh a ban awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pawl ni Athen khovah ahnimouh a ring lahun nah hote kho teh meikaphawknaw seng lah ao e hah a hmu dawkvah, a lungthung khang thai hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hatdawkvah ahni teh sinakok dawk Judahnaw hoi Cathut ka bawk e taminaw hoi a kâdei awh teh, anhla yonae koehai a kâdeikhai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Epikurian hnukkâbangnaw hoi Satoiknaw nihai, Pawl hoi a kâdei awh. A tangawn ni hete tami ni bangmouh a deingai aw ati awh. A tangawn ni teh ramlouknaw e cathut kong vai a dei aw ati awh. Hettelah tinae teh Pawl teh Jisuh hoi boutthawnae kong a pâpho dawk doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hattoteh Pawl hah Aripakas yungim a kaw awh teh, hete cangkhainae a katha e heh kaimouh hai panue kawi maw ati awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, ka thai awh boihoeh e, ka panue awh boihoeh e na dei e hah, kaimanaw hai panue hane ka ngai atipouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Athen khocanaw hoi imyinnaw teh kamthang lawk thai ngainae a hloilah alouklah hoi a tueng baw sak awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hatdawkvah Pawl ni yungim lungui a kangdue teh, Athen nangmouh heh phunglam koe lah na thahmei poung awh tie ka hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na bawk awh e naw ka khet navah, panue hoeh e Cathut hanelah titeh ca na thut awh e thuengnae khoungroe buet touh ka hmu. Nangmouh ni na panue awh hoeh e Cathut lawk kai ni ka dei han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Talaivan hoi talai dawk kaawm e a cawngca kasakkung Cathut teh, kalvan hoi talai ukkung Bawi lah ao teh, tami e kut hoi sak e bawkimnaw thung awmhoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hathloilah, Cathut teh tami hringnae hoi kâhanaw pueng hoi hno cawngca pueng kapoekung lah ao dawkvah, ka panki e boiboe lah tami ni khetyawtnae panki hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cathut ni tami buet touh dawk hoi miphun abuemlah a sak teh, talai van pueng ao sak teh, a tue hoi ao awh nahane hmuen pueng hai lengkaleng a hmoun pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hettelah a tingainae teh, taminaw ni Cathut hah a tawng awh teh, a hmu hai khoum a hmu awh nahane doeh. Atangcalah maimouh buet touh rip hoi Cathut teh kahlat e nahoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, la ka phuengkungnaw ni, atangcalah maimouh teh amae catoun doeh telah a phueng awh e patetlah maimouh teh Bawipa lahoi hring awh, kâroe awh, o awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Maimanaw teh Cathut e canu capa lah o awh dawkvah, Cathut hah tami e thoumnae hno lahoi sui hoi sak e, talung hoi sak e meikaphawknaw hoi a kâvan telah pouk hanelah awmhoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Cathut ni taminaw ni panue thai hoeh e a tue hah banglahai pouk hoeh eiteh, atuteh ram tangkuem kaawm e tami pueng hah pankângai hanelah kâ a poe toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, Cathut ni amamouh ni a khoe e Bawipa lahoi yah, talaivan heh lawkceng nahane hnin sut a hmoun toe. Hote Bawipa hah duenae koehoi a thaw sak teh, tami pueng koe mitnoutnae kamcengcalah a poe toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Duenae koehoi boutthawnae kong hah a thai awh toteh, tami tangawn ni a dudam awh. A tangawn ni hmalah bout thai eisei ati awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hattoteh Pawl teh ahnimouh koehoi a tâco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hatei tami tangawn ni Pawl koe a kambawng awh teh a yuem awh. Ahnimanaw thung dawk Aripakas yung e tami buet touh lah kaawm e Dionisia hoi alouke napui Damaris tinaw hloilah napuinaw hai a bawk awh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hathnukkhu, Pawl teh Athen kho hoi a cei teh Kawrin kho a pha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hote hmuen koe Pontus ram e Judah tami buet touh Aguila a kâhmo. Rom siangpahrang Klaudias ni Judah taminaw pueng Rom kho hoi tâco hanlah kâ a poe dawkvah, Aguila teh Itali lahoi a yu Priscilla hoi Kawrin kho lah a yawng roi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pawl teh ahnimouh roi kâhmo hanlah a cei teh, thaw tawk e a kâvan dawkvah, ahnimouh roi hoi rei ao awh teh thaw a tawk van. A thaw tawk awh e teh rimkasakkung lah ao awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pawl ni Sabbath hnintangkuem sinakok dawk a cangkhai teh, Judahnaw hoi Griknaw hah a pâkhueng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Silas hoi Timote teh Masidonia ram hoi a tho roi nah, Pawl ni Judahnaw koe Jisuh teh Khrih doeh tie kacailah a dei pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hatei Judah miphunnaw ni ahni teh a taran awh teh, a dudam awh navah, ahni ni angki a kathuek teh, nangmae thi teh nangmae lû dawk bawt seh. Kai teh ka hlout. Atu hoi teh Jentelnaw koe ka cei han toe atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hote hmuen koehoi a tâco teh Cathut ka bawk e Justus im vah a cei. Ahnie im teh sinakok teng vah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sinakok kaukkung Krispas hoi imthungkhunaw ni Bawipa teh a yuem awh dawkvah, Kawrin kho e kaawm e tami moikapap ni a thai awh teh a yuem awh dawkvah Baptisma a coe awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tangmin buet touh teh Cathut ni vision lahoi Pawl koe, taket hanh, pou pâpho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, nang hoi cungtalah ka o. Apinihai nang koevah rektapnae thosak mahoeh. Hete kho dawk kaie tami moikapap ao atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hatdawkvah Pawl teh hote khopui dawk kum touh hoi thapa yung taruk touh ao. Ahnimanaw hah Cathut e lawk a cangkhai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hatei, Gallio ni Akhaia ram dawk khobawi lungkângingcalah hoi a tawk nah Judahnaw ni Pawl a taran awh teh lawkcengnae tungkhung hmalah a tâcokhai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahnimouh ni kâlawk hoi kâtaran lah Cathut bawk hane taminaw a pâkhueng telah ati awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pawl ni hai lawk dei hanlah a pahni a ang navah, Gallio ni Judahnaw koevah nangmouh Judahnaw kalan hoeh e lawk, nahoeh pawiteh kâdumkâyennae lawk buetbuet touh lah awm pawiteh kai ni na lawk ka ngai han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hatei nangmae lawknaw, kâlawknaw, minnaw hoi ka kâkuen e lah awm pawiteh, namamouh roeroe ni na dei awh han. Kai teh hot patet e naw hah ka dei ngai hoeh atipouh teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />ahnimanaw hah lawkcengnae tungkhung koehoi a pâlei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hattoteh sinakok ukkung Sosthenes hah a man awh teh, lawkcengnae tungkhung hmalah a hem awh. Hatei Gallio ni hotnaw hah banglahai ngai laipalah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pawl teh Kawrin khovah tueng moikasaw ao hnukkhu a hmaunawnghanaw koevah ka dam lah atipouh teh, Siria ram lah long hoi a cei. Ahni hoi Priscilla hoi Aguila haiyah a cei van. Lawk a kam e patetlah Kenkhrea khovah a lû a ngaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hahoi Efisa kho a pha awh navah, hote hmuen koe Priscilla hoi Aguila teh a ceitakhai teh sinakok vah a kâen teh, Judahnaw hoi kamthang lawk a kâpankhai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Taminaw ni ahni teh hnin kasawlah o hanlah a dei awh ei, ngai pouh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cathut ngainae lah awm pawiteh, nangmouh koe hmalah bout ka tho han, ati pouh teh ahnimanaw kut a man hnukkhu Efisa kho hoi long hoi a tâco.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kaisarea kho a pha hnukkhu Jerusalem lah a takhang teh kawhmoun hah kut a man. Haw hoi Antiok kho a cei cathuk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pawl teh hote hmuen koe hnin kasawlah ao hnukkhu Galati hoi Frigia ramnaw pueng dawk a kâhlai teh a hnukkâbangnaw a cak sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hatnavah, Alexandria kho kaawm e Judah tami buet touh Apollos ati awh e Efisa khovah a tho. Ahni teh lawk dei ka thoum e hoi Cakathoung dawk athakaawm e lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahni teh Bawipa e lamthungnaw a panue teh muitha koe lah thao laihoi Jisuh e kamthang hah taminaw koe a cangkhai. Hatei Jawhan e baptisma dueng doeh a panue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahni teh sinakok vah taranhawi laihoi a pâpho. Priscilla hoi Aquila ni a lawk dei e a thai roi nah alouklah a hrawi teh Cathut e lawk hah kacaicalah a cangkhai roi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Apollos ni Akhaia ram lah a cei hane a ngai navah a hnukkâbangnaw ni, hote hmuen koe kaawm e a hnukkâbangnaw ni a dawn thai awh nahanelah, ca a thut pouh awh. Hawvah a pha toteh Cathut pahren lahoi ka yuem e moikapap a kabawp.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Jisuh teh Khrih lah ao tie hah kamcengcalah Cakathoung dawk kahawicalah a patue teh Judahnaw hah reprep a yue.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kawrin kho Apollos ao navah Pawl teh mon lam hoi Efisa kho a cei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A hnukkâbangnaw hoi a kâhmo toteh, nangmouh ni na yuem awh navah, Kathoung Muitha na coe awh toung maw telah a pacei. Ahnimouh ni Kathoung Muitha coe hoi coe hoeh e ka panuek awh hoeh atipouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hattoteh Pawl niyah, bangpatet e baptisma maw na coe awh vaw, telah let a pacei navah, ahnimouh ni, Jawhan e baptisma doeh ka coe ati awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pawl ni Jawhan teh amae a hnuklah ka tho hane Bawipa hah yuem awh haw titeh pankângainae baptisma doeh na poe awh. Hottelah a dei navah Jisuh Khrih doeh a dei ngai nah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahnimouh ni a yuem awh toteh Jisuh min dawk baptisma a coe awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pawl ni ahnimouh lathueng kut a toung pouh toteh ahnimouh koe Kathoung Muitha a pha. Hatdawkvah ahnimanaw teh alouke lawknaw a dei awh teh, profet lawk a pâpho awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahnimanaw teh abuemlahoi hrahlaikahni touh a pha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hathnukkhu Pawl teh thapa yung thum touh thung sinakok vah Cathut uknaeram kamthang hah taranhawi laihoi a pâpho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hatei tami tangawn teh a lungpata awh dawkvah yuem laipalah tamimaya hmalah lamthung pathoe lawk a dei awh dawkvah, a hnukkâbangnaw hah a kaw teh ahnimouh koehoi a tâco teh, Tirannus sengim dawkvah hnintangkuem a cangkhai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kum hni touh thung hottelah a kâroe dawkvah Judahnaw, Griknaw hoi Asia ram kaawmnaw pueng ni Bawipa e lawkkatang teh a thai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cathut ni Pawl kut dawk hoi ka talue e kângairuhnonaw a sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A tak dawk e hnica, hoehpawiteh a kâyeng e hnica a sin awh teh, ka dam hoeh e tak dawk a nep awh navah, ahnimae patawnae a kahma teh muitha kathoutnaw hai a tâco awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hatnavah yuengyoe kâva e Judah miphun, camkathoumnaw ni, muithakathout ni a man e taminaw koevah, Pawl ni a pâpho e Jisuh min lahoi kâ na poe titeh, Jisuh min hah tanouknae lah a hno awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hottelah ka tet e naw teh Judah tami vaihma bawi Skiva e capa sari touh hah doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hatnavah muitha kathoutnaw ni, Jisuh hai ka panue, Pawl hai ka panue, nangmanaw teh apinaw maw telah ati hnukkhu,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hote muitha kathoutnaw ni a man e tami ni, ahnimanaw hah a cu sin teh, a kathuek a kayak dawkvah caici lah hmâtan hoi a yawng awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Efisa kho kaawm e Judahnaw hoi Griknaw ni hote kamthang a thai awh navah, a taki awh teh Bawipa Jisuh min hah bari kaawm lah a pholen awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka yuem e tami moikapap a tho awh teh, amamae a tawksak awh e naw hah a pâpho awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Camkathoumnaw ni hai amamae hnopainaw hoi cauknaw hah tamimaya hmalah a tâcokhai awh teh, hmai a pau awh. Hote cauknaw phu to navah ngun tangka thong 50 touh phu a pha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hettelah hoiyah, Bawipa e lawkkatang teh thaonae hoi a roung teh tânae a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hathnukkhu Pawl teh Masidonia ram hoi Akhaia ram lahoi Jerusalem cei hanelah Muitha patounnae lahoi lawk a tâtueng teh, Jerusalem ka cei hnukkhu Rom khopui hai ka hmu han a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hatdawkvah ahni kabawmkung Timote hoi Erastas hah Masidonia ram lah a patoun. Ama teh Asia ram vah dongdeng ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hatnavah kamthang lawk kecu dawk ruengrueng ati awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Bangkong nama tetpawiteh nguntui kahlun e Demetrias teh Atemis cathut napui e bawkimca hlun laihoi nguntui kahlunnaw hanlah tawntanae lah a coung sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Demetrias ni ama patet e taminaw hah a pâkhueng teh, huikonaw, hete thaw hoi maimouh teh tawnta awh tie teh na panue awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hatei, hete Pawl tie niyah, kut hoi sak e teh Cathut nahoeh ati teh Efisa kho e taminaw dueng laipalah Asia ram e tami pueng hai a dumyen teh lam a hmang sak toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hete lawk ni maimae min a mathoe sak dueng laipalah ka lentoe e Atemis cathut napui e bawkim hai banglah noutna hanlah awmhoeh toung vaiteh, Asia ram hoi talaivan pueng ni bawk awh e cathut napui e bahu teh a kahma han toe tie ngaihrinae ao telah a dei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hote lawk hah ahnimouh ni a thai awh navah, a lung thouk a khuek awh teh, Efisanaw e Atemis teh a lentoe telah a hram awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hattoteh khobuem ruengrueng ati awh. Taminaw niyah Pawl hnukkâbang e Masidonia tami Gaius hoi Aristarkas hah a man awh teh, pawi thungvah vai touh lahoi a kâen awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hote taminaw koe Pawl ni kâen hane a ngai ei a hnukkâbangnaw ni a ngang awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pawl e a hui, Asia ram e khobawinaw ni hai pawi thung kâen hoeh hanelah a kahei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Taminaw teh ruengrueng ati awh dawkvah alouklouk lah a hram awh. Bangpatet ni teh bangdawkmaw kamkhueng a aw tie hai kamceng lah panuek awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Judahnaw ni Alexander hah hmalah a tâco sak awh teh tami tangawn ni a lungkuep awh dawkvah, Alexander ni a kut a kahek teh kamkhuengnaw koe a dei pouh hanelah a kâcai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hatei ahni teh Judah tami doeh tie a panue awh navah, tami pueng ni, Efisanaw e Atemis teh a lentoe, telah suimilam kahni touh hane lawk suetalah a hram awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hathnukkhu khothung e cakathutkung ni kamkhueng e taminaw cing ati sak teh, Efisa taminaw voi Efisa kho teh lentoe Atemis cathut napui e bawkim hoi, kalvan hoi kabawt e meikaphawk hah ka pâkuem e kho lah ao tie hah ka panuek hoeh e tami apimaw kaawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Het hateh oun thai hoeh e lah ao dawkvah bangcahai pouk laipalah, hrumhram sak laipalah duem o hanelah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh nangmouh ni na man awh e hete taminaw ni nangmae bawkim na lawm awh hoeh, maimae cathut napui hah pacekpahlek awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Hatdawkvah Demetrias hoi nguntui kahlun e naw, nangmouh ni buetbuet touh toe hane awm pawiteh toeim paawng lah ao na yoe. Khobawinaw hai ao dawkvah ama maroi kâhmo na nei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Hatei alouke kong dawk pawiteh kamceng lah kamkhuengnae koe lawk tâtueng hanlah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Sahnin e hno ka tâcawt e dawkvah kamceng e banghai awmhoeh. Hettelah ruengruengtinae dawkvah maimouh letlang na toe awh pawiteh, kaimouh ni hete kambawngnae dawkvah ka dei thai a mahoeh atipouh teh,
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ruengrueng tinae a roum hnukkhu, Pawl ni a hnukkâbangnaw a kaw teh kut a man hnukkhu kadamcalah awm awh titeh Masidonia ram lah a ceitakhai .
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Haw e ram thung kaawm e a hnukkâbangnaw thapoe lawk a dei hnukkhu Grik ram a pha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Haw e ram thung thapa yung thum touh ao hnukkhu, Siria ram lah long hoi cei han a kâcai nah Judahnaw ni arulahoi padim han ati awh torei teh, Masidonia ram koe lahoi bout ban hane a kâcai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pawl hoi cungtalah Berea tami Pirrhas capa Sopater hoi Thesalon tami Aristarkas Sekandus, Derbi tami Gaius hoi Asia tami Timote, Taisikas hoi Trophimus tinaw teh ahni koevah cungtalah a cei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hmalah a cei teh Troas kho hoi a ring awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tonphuenhoehe vaiyei pawi abaw hnukkhu Filippi kho hoi long hoi a tâco teh hnin panga touh a ro hnukkhu Troas kho a pha awh, Hawvah yat touh ao awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A yat e apasuek hnin vah vaiyei raen hanelah ahnukkâbangnaw a tho awh teh, cungtalah a kamkhueng awh. A tangtho teh Pawl a cei hanelah coungkacoe lah ao toung dawkvah karumsaning totouh a pâpho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kaimouh ka kamkhuengnae imvan hmaiim moikapap a paang awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A min Utikhas tie thoundoun teh hlalangaw teng a tahung. Muet a i teh Pawl ni kamthang lawk a dei lahun nah imvan hoi talai pou a bo teh a ro lah a rakhun awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pawl ni a kum teh ahnie a tak dawkvah a tabei teh calumcalum tet awh hanh haw, bangkongtetpawiteh a hringnae kâha pout hoeh rah ati teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />imvan a luen, vaiyei a ca awh teh khodai totouh a pâpho pouh hnukkhu hoi a ceitakhai .
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hote bout kahring e thoundoun ca hah a hrawi awh teh, a lungmawng awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Long koe hmaloe ka cei awh teh, Assos kho koehoi Pawl kâcui sak hanelah ka cei awh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, Pawl teh mon lam lahoi cei hanelah a kâcai teh hottelah lawk a thui dawk doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Assos kho dawk kaimouh hoi kâhmo awh toteh long dawk a kâcui van teh Mitilen kho lah ka cei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Haw hoi ka tâco awh teh a tangtho vah Khios tuilum ka pha awh. A tangtho patuen vah Samos ka pha awh teh a tangtho hnin vah Miletus ka pha awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hettelah karang karang cei ngainae teh Asia ram dawk atueng baw sak laipalah Efisa kho ceitakhai hanlah kâcai awh dawk doeh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, coung thai pawiteh pentikos hnin hoehnahlan Jerusalem vah pha hanelah ka ngai awh dawkvah hettelah karang karang cei ngainae doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Miletus kho a pha hoi Pawl ni Efisa kho lah tami a patoun teh kacuenaw hah a kaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahnimouh a pha toteh Pawl ni, Asia ram ka pha hnin hoi, nangmae hmalah bangtelamaw ka hring tie na panue awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kai teh kârahnoumnae, mitphi bonae, hoi Judahnaw ni rucat na poenae thungup hoiyah Bawipa e a thaw hah ka tawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kai ni nangmouh hanelah hawinae kaawm hane naw hah hnuk kâhnawn laipalah, nangmouh koe ka pâpho teh, taminaw hmalah nakunghai, im touh hnukkhu im touh nakunghai na cangkhai awh teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cathut hmalah pankângainae hoi maimae Bawipa Jisuh Khrih yuemnae kongnaw hah, Judahnaw hoi Griknaw hah ka cangkhai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Atuteh muitha lamhrawinae lahoi Jerusalem ka cei han, kho thung bangpatet runae maw kâhmo han ka panuek hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hat nakunghai runae hoi rektapnae ni sut na ring e hah Kathoung Muitha teh kho tangkuem kai kapanuekkhaikung lah o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hatei, ka yawng hane kawi hah a pout totouh ka yawng teh, Cathut lungmanae kamthang kahawi kampangkhai hanelah, Bawipa Jisuh koehoi ka coe e thaw tawknae hah lunghawi laihoi ka cum thai nahanelah awm pawiteh ka hringnae patenghai ka pasai hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Atuteh Cathut uknaeram kong ka dei nah nangmanaw ni ka mei bout na hmawt a mahoeh toe tie ka panue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hatdawkvah tami pueng e thi hoi kai kamthoung toe tie sahnin vah nangmouh koe ka pâpho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lung kâounnae awm laipalah Cathut e pouknae pueng teh nangmouh koe he ka dei toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nangmouh teh namahoima nakunghai, tuhunaw pueng nakunghai, kâhruetcuet laihoi khenyawn awh. Bawipa amae a thi hoi a ran e kawhmoun hah nangmouh ni khetyawt sak hanelah, Kathoung Muitha ni nangmouh teh tukhoumkung lah na rawi awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, ka yinhnuk nah, ka huencawn e Asuinaw ni tunaw pahrennae tawn laipalah nangmouh thung a kâen han tie ka panue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Nangmouh thung e a hnukkâbangnaw hai, ama koe lah sawn hanelah, ceipayonnae ka pâpho e tami a tho awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hatdawkvah tuehmue awh. Kai ni kum thum touh thung karum khodai tami pueng mitphi hoi na cangkhai e pahnim awh hanh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hmaunawnghanaw, atu kai ni nangmouh Cathut koe na hnawng awh. Nangmouh na roung awh nahan, tami kathoungnaw hoi nangmanaw râw poe hanelah ka tet thai e Cathut e a lungmanae dawk nangmouh na hnawng awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Kai ni api e sui ngun hnopainaw hai ka nôe hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hete ka kut hoi kama hoi rei kaawmnaw e pankinae pueng ka tawk tie hah na panue awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hottelah panki laihoi ka tawk teh, a thakayounnaw hah kabawp kawi lah ao tie hoi, poenae teh dâwnae hlak yawhawinae ao telah Bawipa Jisuh ama ni a dei e lawk hah na pâkuem awh hanelah ao telah a dei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Pawl ni a dei hnukkhu khok a cuengkhuem teh ahnimouh hoi cungtalah a ratoum awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Abuemlahoi a khuika awh teh Pawl teh a tapam awh teh a paco awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ka mei bout na hmawt a mahoeh toe tie Pawl ni a dei e a thai awh dawkvah lungmathoe laihoi Pawl hah long koe totouh a thak awh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ahnimouh koehoi Kos tuilum koelah long hoi pou ka cei awh. A tangtho vah Rhodes ka pha awh teh, haw hoi Patara kho dawk ka pha awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hahoi Phoenicia lah ka cet e long buet touh ka kâcui awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Saipras tuilum ka hmu awh toteh hote hmuen koehoi avoilah hoi ka cei awh teh Siria lah ka raka awh navah Taire kho ka pha awh. Hawvah long dawk e hnonaw ka rasa awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hawvah a hnukkâbangnaw ka kâhmo awh teh ahnimouh koe hnin sari touh ka o awh. Ahnimouh ni Pawl hah Jerusalem lah a cei hoeh nahan Muitha lahoi a dei pouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahnimouh koe ka o hnukkhu hoi hot koehoi bout ka kamthaw awh. A yu a canaw abuemlahoi cungtalah kho teng totouh na thak awh. Tuipui teng khokcuengkhuem laihoi ka ratoum awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hahoi buet touh hoi buet touh kut ka kâman awh hnukkhu kaimouh teh long dawk ka luen awh teh ahnimouh hai amamouh im lah a ban awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hahoi Taire kho hoi Ptolamais kho lah pou ka cei awh teh hawvah hmaunawnghanaw hoi ka kâhmo awh teh hnin touh ka o awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Atangtho bout ka cei awh teh Kaisarea khovah ka pha awh. Hawvah, Jerusalem vah kabawmkung hanlah a rawi awh e tami sari touh dawk buet touh lah kaawm e Filip im vah ka luen awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahni koe profet lah kaawm e a canu pali touh ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hawvah kasawhnawn lah ka o awh teh Akabus tie profet buet touh Judah ram lahoi a tho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahni teh kaimouh koe a tho navah Pawl e taisawm a la pouh teh amae a kutkhok a pâkhi teh, Judahnaw ni hete taisawm katawnkung hah Jerusalem kho hettelah a katek awh vaiteh Jentelnaw e kut dawk poe lah ao han telah Kathoung Muitha ni a dei telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hote lawk ka thai awh nah kaimouh hoi haw kaawmnaw ni Pawl hah Jerusalem lah a cei hoeh nahan ka haw awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hatnavah Pawl ni, nangmouh ni na khuika awh teh, kai lungrei na thaisak awh! Kai ni Jisuh e a min kecu dawk Jerusalem khovah katek hane dueng laipalah ka due han totouh coungkacoe lah ka o toe telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kaimouh ni ka haw hla awh toteh, Cathut a ngainae patetlah lawiseh ka ti awh teh duem ka o awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hawvah dongdeng ka o awh hnukkhu, ka kârasoup awh teh Jerusalem lah ka cei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kaisarea kho hoi a hnukkâbang tangawn hai kaimouh hoi cungtalah a tho awh teh kaimouh ka luen awh nahanelah ka rasoun e, apasueke a hnukkâbang lah kaawm e Saipras tami Manason koe na ceikhai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Jerusalem kho ka pha awh navah hmaunawnghanaw ni lunghawicalah hoi na dawn awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Atangtho vah Pawl hoi cungtalah Jem koe ka cei awh teh kacuenaw hoi ao awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pawl ni ahnimanaw kut a man awh teh a thaw tawk e lahoi Jentelnaw koe Cathut ni thaw a tawknae kongnaw hah buet touh hnukkhu buet touh a dei pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahnimouh ni a thai awh navah Cathut a pholen awh. Hahoi ahnimouh ni Pawl koe, ka nawngha, na panue e patetlah Judahnaw touklek thai hoe e, kâlawk dawk a lungkatangnaw ni a yuem awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jentelnaw thung kaawm e Judah tami pueng hah Mosi e kâlawk pahnawt awh nateh vuensoma laipalah hoi Judah phung tarawi awh han loe telah na cangkhai ti teh kamthang sut a dei awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nang na tho e hai be a panue a han doeh. Hatdawkvah bang ne sak awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, kaimouh ni na dei pouh e patetlah sak lah a. Hivah lawkkamnae ka sak e tami pali touh ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahnimouh hoi reirei cet nateh thoungnae phung lam sak kawi hah sak awh nateh, lû luengpalueng lah ngawnae aphu hah rawng pouh. Hottelah na sak pawiteh tami pueng ni na kong a dei awh e hah a tang nahoeh tet awh vaiteh, nang teh Mosi e kâlawk ka tarawi e doeh tie hah tami pueng ni a panue awh han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jentelnaw ka yuem e naw kong dawk kaimouh ni ca na patawn awh toe. Meikaphawk bawknae rawcanaw hah cat awh hanh, a thi cat awh hanh, lahuen kara e moi pueng cat awh hanh, kamsoumhoehe napui tongpa yonnae sak a hanh tie lawk tâtuengnae hah na patawn awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hattoteh Pawl ni hote tami pali touh hah a ceikhai teh a tangtho vah thoungnae phunglam hah a sak khai hnukkhu, bawkim thung a kâen awh teh thoung nahane atueng apout hoehroukrak atueng na yit touh maw a ro han, hote atueng a baw hnukkhu thuengnae lengkaleng sak hane hah vaihma koe a dei pouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hnin sari hnin a kuep tawmlei torei teh, Asia ram lahoi ka tho e Judah taminaw ni Pawl hah bawkim thung a hmu awh. Tami pueng a puen awh teh Pawl hah a man awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Isarel taminaw na kabawm a haw! Hete tami nahoehmaw, Isarel taminaw kâtaran sak hanelah, Mosi e kâlawk pahnawt hane hoi hete hmuen pahnawt hanelah kacangkhaikung lah meng ao. Hete bawkim thungvah Grik taminaw bout a kâenkhai teh a kamhnawng sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hettelah a dei e heh Efisa tami Trophimus hah Pawl hoi kho thungvah a hmu awh teh Pawl ni hote tami hah bawkim thung a kâenkhai telah a pouk a dawk doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hatnavah khothung ruengrueng ati awh. Pawl hah a man awh teh bawkim thung hoi a tâcokhai awh. Karang poung lah takhangnaw koung a khan awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Taminaw ni Pawl hah thei hane a panki awh navah, Jerusalem kho teh ruengrueng ati awh telah ransa 1,000 touk ka uk e Rom ransabawi ni kamthang a thai navah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />vai touh lahoi Rom ransa bawinaw hoi ransanaw teh yawng laihoi a tho awh. Ransabawi hoi ransanaw a tho awh e a hmu awh navah, Pawl ka hem e naw a kâhat awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ransabawi ni Pawl a man teh sumbawtaruinaw kahni touh hoi pâkhit awh atipouh. Hahoi a kamthaw awh teh hete tami heh apimaw, bangmaw a sak, telah a pacei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Taminaw ni alouklouk lah a hram awh. Ransabawi ni kamcenglah a panue thai hoeh dawkvah, Pawl hah ransaim imthung lah kâenkhai hanelah kâ a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Pawl teh khalailu a pha navah taminaw hoehoe a lungkhuek awh dawkvah, Pawl hah a kâkayawt awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, Pawl hah thet awh, thet awh telah hoehoe a hram awh dawk doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ransaim thungvah Pawl a kâenkhai tawmlei Pawl ni bawipa, nang hoi lawk kâpan thai han maw telah atipouh. Ransabawi ni Grik lawk na panue maw atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Hat pawiteh nang teh, hnuk lae tami thong pali touh kahrawngum ka cetkhai e dingca bawi Izip tami nahoehmaw telah a pacei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Pawl ni, Kai teh Judah phun, Cilicia ram thung kamthang e kho Tarshish hoi ka tho e tami doeh. Taminaw koe lawk na dei sak haw atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ransabawi ni hai lawk a dei sak. Pawl teh khalai dawk a kangdue teh a kut a nâ pouh teh, taminaw hah sairasuep lah ao awh. Hatnavah ahni ni Hebru lawk lahoi lawk a dei.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hmaunawngha hoi a nupanaw, atu kai ni ka dei e lawk kahawicalah thai awh haw telah a dei navah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hebru lawk hoi a dei e a thai awh navah hoe cing ati awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pawl ni kai teh Cilicia ram Tarshish kho dawk ka khe e, Judah tami buet touh lah ka o. Hatei hete kho dawk ka roung teh, Gamaliel kut rahim vah mintoenaw e phung lawk hah kacaicalah ka kamtu niteh, sahnin nangmouh pueng Cathut hanelah na lung a tang awh e patetlah kai hai ka lung a tang van.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kai ni hete lam ka dawn e napui tongpa tet hoeh, ka pâkhi teh thongim thung ka pakhum teh, a due han ditouh ouk ka rektap toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hot patetlah vaihma kacue koehoi kamtawng teh, kacuenaw pueng teh, kai koe lah koung na kampangkhai awh. Kai ni hai ahnimanaw koe ca ka la teh, Damaskas kho e kaawm e, hote phung lah kâen e naw hah man vaiteh rektap hanelah Jerusalem hoi Damaskas lah ka cei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hatei Damaskas kho teng ka pha nah, kanîthun e tueng navah, kalvan hoi puenghoi ka ang e ni kai pet na kalup lah pheng a tue.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hahoi kai teh talai ka rawp teh, Sawl Sawl nang ni bangdawk maw, kai hah na rektap vaw telah na dei pouh e lawk ka thai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kai ni yah, Bawipa, nang teh apimaw telah ka pacei torei teh, kai teh nang ni na rektap e Nazareth kho e Jisuh doeh, telah na ti pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kai hoi rei kaawm e naw ni angnae a hmu awh eiteh kai hanlah a dei e lawk teh thai awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kai ni hai Bawipa, bang mouh ka sak han ka ti pouh navah, Bawipa ni thaw nateh Damaskas kho cet haw. Hawvah na sak hane kai ni na dei pouh han na ti pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kai teh hote angnae bahu ni na tue torei teh ka mit a dawn toung dawkvah, rei kaawm e naw ni Damaskas kho na hrawi awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hatnavah Cathut ka bari e Damaskas kho e min kamthang e Judah tami Ananias ni,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />kai koe a tho teh ka teng a kangdue. Ka nawngha Sawl na mit ang seh ati navah ka mit a ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahni ni mintoenaw e Cathut ngainae panue sak hanlah thoseh, tamikalan hmu thai nahane thoseh, ahnie lawk dei pouh hane thoseh, nang teh sut na hmoun toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nang teh na hmu e hoi na thai e pueng tami pueng e hmalah kapanuekkhaikung lah na o han a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bangkongmaw atu rap na o. Thaw nateh Bawipa min kaw haw. Baptisma coe haw, na yonnae pâsu haw na ti pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hathnukkhu Jerusalem vah bout ka tho teh, bawkim thung ka ratoum lahun nah ka pouknae a mawm teh, Bawipa hah ka hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bawipa ni kai hoi kâkuen e lawkpanuesaknae hah taminaw ni a dâw awh hoeh han dawkvah, Jerusalem vah rap awm laipalah karang tâcawt leih na ti pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kai nihaiyah, Bawipa Sinakok buet touh hoi buet touh koe ka cei teh nang na kayuemnaw ka theituk teh thawng ka pabo e a panue awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nang kampangkhai lah kaawm e Stiven hah a thei awh navah kai kama roeroe raw hnâbo lahoi ka sak teh, kathetnaw e khohna ka ring pouh kung lah ka o.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hateiteh, Bawipa ni, Cet leih, ramhlanae koe kaawm e Jentelnaw koe kai ni na patoun han telah kai koe na ti pouh, telah a dei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Het totouh a dei e a thai pouh teh, hot patet e tami hah talai van hring hanelah kamcu hoeh, thet awh titeh lawk kacaipounglah a hram awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Taminaw niyah hottelah a hramki awh teh, a khohnanaw hah a kahek awh teh, vaiphu kahlun lah a kahei awh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Rom ransabawi kalen ni taminaw hah a kaw sak teh, ransaim thung kâen sak hanlah kâ a poe. Taminaw pueng ni bangkongmaw ahni hah telah a taran awh teh, telah a hram awh tie panue hane a ngai dawkvah, ruitaboung hoi hem vaiteh akungkhei hanelah kâ a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ahni teh phaivuenrui hoi a katek awh hnukkhu, a teng kangdout e ransabawi hanlah nangmouh ni Rom tami buet touh heh akungkhei laipalah hemnae kâ na tawn a maw telah a pacei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ransabawi ni hote lawk hah a thai toteh ransabawi kalen koe a cei teh, nang bangtelamaw ti han. Ahni ni kai teh Rom tami doeh na ti pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hahoi ransabawi kalen e teh Pawl koe a tho teh, kai koe na dei pouh haw, nang teh Rom tami na maw telah a pacei toteh ue a atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ransabawi kalen e ni kai teh, Rom tami lah o nahanelah tangka moikapap poe laihoi doeh ka o thai atipouh navah, Pawl ni, kai teh Rom tami lah ka khe atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hatdawkvah ahni akungkhei hane naw teh ahni koehoi karanglah a kâkhoe awh. Ransabawi kalen ni hai Pawl heh Rom tami lah ao e hah a panue toteh a pâkhi e hah a taki.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Atangtho vah ransabawi teh Judahnaw ni yon a pen awh e hah kamcengcairalah a panue han a ngai dawkvah, Pawl kateknae rathap hanelah kâ a poe. Vaihma kalennaw hoi lawkcengkungnaw pueng a kamkhueng sak. Pawl hah a kaw awh teh, ahnimae hmalah a kangdue sak awh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pawl ni sanhedrin lawkcengkungnaw hah takuetluet a khet teh, hmaunawnghanaw, kai teh atu totouh ka tawksak e dawk kahawi e thoehawi panuenae lungthin hoi Cathut hmalah a thoung, ati pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hatnavah vaihma kacue Ananias ni a teng ka kangdout e taminaw koe, Pawl e a pahni tambei pouh awh telah kâ a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pawl nihai, ka pangaw hluk e tangkom, Cathut ni nama na hem han atipouh. Nang ni kai heh tahung laihoi kâlawk patetlah lawk na ceng nahlangva vah, kâlawk na tapoe teh kai hem hanelah kâ na poe maw, atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ateng ka kangdout e naw nihai, nang ni Cathut e vaihma kacue na dudam, ati pouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pawl nihai, hmaunawnghanaw, ahni hah vaihma kacue tie ka panuek hoeh, Cakathoung ni na miphun ka ukkungnaw na pathoe mahoeh telah a dei, atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pawl ni haw kaawm e tami atangawn teh Sadusinaw, alouknaw teh Farasinaw tie a panue dawkvah, hmaunawnghanaw kai teh Farasi buet touh lah ka o. Farasi e a capa lahai ka o. Kai teh kadoutnaw boutthawnae ngaihawinae kecu dawk hoi akungkhei e lah ka o telah sanhedrin lawkcengnae hmalah hram laihoi a dei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hottelah Pawl ni a dei torei teh, Farasinaw hoi Sadusinaw hai lawk apap awh teh, kahni touh lah a kâkapek awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, Sadusinaw ni boutthawnae awmhoeh, kalvantami awmhoeh, muitha awmhoeh telah ati awh. Farasinaw ni teh hotnaw koung ao telah a yuem awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hahoi, hoe a hram awh teh Farasinaw koe e cakathutkungnaw bangpatet ni a kangdue awh teh, ahni koe a yonnae tica hai ka hmawt awh hoeh, Muitha nahoeh pawiteh, kalvantami buetbuet touh ni a dei pouh thai, telah a oun awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hoe kâounnae ao dawkvah ransabawi ni, Pawl hah vekrasen lah sawn a langvaih ati dawkvah, ransanaw koe Pawl hah amamae ransaim imthung lah a ceikhai hane kâ a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hatnae tangmin lah Pawl koe Bawipa a kangdue teh, lakueng hanh, Jerusalem vah kaie ka kong na kampangkhai e patetlah, Rom kho hai na kampangkhai han atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khodai toteh Judahnaw ni kho a khan awh teh, Pawl thei hoe roukrak banghai canei hoeh hanelah thoe a kâbo awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hottelah arulah ka kâdei e naw, abuemlah tami 40 touh hlai a pha awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ahnimouh ni vaihma bawinaw hoi kacuenaw koe a cei awh teh, kaimouh ni Pawl ka thei awh hoeh roukrak banghai ka cat a mahoeh, telah thoe ka kâbo awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hatdawkvah nangmouh hoi sanhedrin lawkcengkungnaw ni ahnie a kong kahawicalah pacei han na ngai awh e patetlah ka sak vaiteh nangmouh koe Pawl a hrawi awh thai nahan Rom ransabawi koe thaisak awh. Hi a pha hoehnahlan thei hanlah coungkacoelah ka o awh han, atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hote kho a khangnae hah Pawl e tawncanu e a capa ni a thai navah thongim thung a kâen teh Pawl koe a dei pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hatnavah Pawl ni ransabawi buet touh a kaw teh, ransabawi koevah hete nawsai ni lawk dei hane a tawn dawkvah, ahni hah ransabawi kalen koe cetkhai haw atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ransabawi ni a ceikhai teh ransabawi kalen koe a thokhai. Thongkabawt e Pawl ni, kai hah na kaw teh, hete nawsai ni nang koe hrawi hanelah a kâhei. Ahni ni nang koe lawk dei hane ao atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ransabawi ni hote nawsai e kut a kuet pouh teh, aloukcalah a kaw teh, kai koe na dei hane lawk teh bangmaw atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hote nawsai ni, Judahnaw ni Pawl hah, hoe kamceng lah pacei hane boiboe lah a kâsak awh teh, tangtho vah sanhedrin lawkcengnae koe kaw hanelah nang koe kâhei hanelah a kâcai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hatei ahnimae lawk tang pouh hanh. Bangkongtetpawiteh ahnimouh thung dawk tami 40 touh hlai ni arulah hoi Pawl hah a pawp awh. Pawl ka thei awh hoehroukrak ka catnet a mahoeh ati awh teh, thoe a kâbo awh. Atu patenghai coungkacoe lah ao awh teh, bawipa, nange lawk doeh a ring awh toe atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ransabawi ni, hete kongnaw kai koe na dei e heh api koehai dei pouh hanh lah atipouh teh hote nawsai hah bout a ban sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hathnukkhu, ransabawi kalen e ni ransabawi kahni touh a kaw teh, Kaisarea cei hanelah ransa cumhni touh sut kârakueng awh. Hahoi marangransanaw 70 touh, tahroe ka patuem thai e cumhni touh hai kârakuengkhai awh nateh, atu tangmin suimilam tako nah kamthaw hanlah sut kârakueng awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pawl kâcui nahanelah marang sut hmoun pouh awh. Khobawi Felik koe kahawicalah phatkhai awh telah lawk a thui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hathnukkhu ransabawi ni ca a thut teh telah a patawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Klaudias Lisias ni khobawi Felik koevah ca na patawn. Nang koevah hnâroumnae awmseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Judahnaw ni hete tami heh a man awh teh thei han toe ati awh navah, ahni teh Rom tami doeh tie ka panue toteh ransanaw hoi ka rungngang awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Yon a hnei awh e hah bangne tie panue han ka ngai dawkvah, sanhedrin lawkcengnae hmalah ka kaw navah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />ahni teh amamae kâlawk hoi kâkuen e kamcan hoi yon a pen awh teh, duekhai kawi hoehpawiteh, thongim kamungkhai kawi yonnae a tawn tie ka hmawt hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hatei, Judah tami tangawn ni ahni thei hanelah a kâcai awh tie ka thai dawkvah nang koe karanglah ka thak. Yon kapen e naw hai nang na hmalah a dei awh nahanelah kâ ka poe toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hat toteh, ransabawi ni kâ a poe e patetlah Pawl hah Antipatris kho totouh karum vah a thak awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Atangtho teh marangransanaw ni pou a ceikhai awh. Alouknaw teh a ban awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Kaisarea totouh a ceikhai awh teh, khobawi koe, ca a poe awh teh, Pawl hai ama kut dawk a poe awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Khobawi ni ca a touk teh Pawl teh nâ ram e maw telah a pacei. Cilicia dawk e doeh tie a panue hoi teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />na katoekungnaw a tho torei vah, nange lai teh na ceng pouh han telah a titeh, Pawl hah Herod siangpahrang im vah khoup ring awh telah ransanaw kâ a poe.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hnin panga touh aloum hnukkhu vaihma kacue Ananias teh kacuenaw hoi laicei Tertullas tihoi Kaisarea kho lah a cathuk awh. Hahoi, laicei ni ram kaukkung koevah Pawl teh yon a pen awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pawl a kaw awh teh, Tertullas niyah Felik koevah Pawl e kong teh hettelah dei han a kamtawng. Nangmouh rahim vah tueng moikasaw karoumcalah ka o awh teh, na khokhangnae lahoi hete miphunnaw a roung awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hete thaw tawknae heh kho tangkuem lunghawi laihoi ka tawk awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, kasawlah kai ni na tarawk hoeh nahanelah, pahren lahoi kaie lawk ka dei e hah na thai pouh haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kamcan dueng ka sak e hete tami heh talaivan pueng dawk kaawm e Judahnaw koevah lawkpungnae ao nahanlah tha ka poe e lah ao teh, Nazareth bawknae dawk darkhing ka hem e kahrawikung buet touh lah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahni teh bawkim hai khet kamcu hoeh lah sak hane a panki dawkvah, kaimouh ni ahni teh ka man awh. Hathnukkhu, ahni teh kamamae kâlawk patetlah lawkceng han ka ti awh navah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />ransabawi Lisias a tho teh kaimae kut dawk hoi na lawp awh teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />ahni katoenaw hai nang koe tho hanelah kâ a poe. Hete hnonaw abuemlahoi kâkuen lah nama roeroe ni lawk na ceng pawiteh ahnie lathueng kaimanaw ni yon kapen awh e pueng hah na panue han doeh telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Judahnaw ni hai hate lawknaw teh atang doeh ati awh teh hnâ rip a bo awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hahoi ram ukkung ni Pawl hah lawk dei van nahanlah a kut a dâw pouh. Pawl ni hete miphunnaw heh kum moikasaw thung lawkcengkung lah na o tie ka panue dawkvah lunghawi laihoi nang koe lawk ka dei vai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jerusalem vah Cathut bawk hanelah ka ceinae heh hnin hlaikahni touh hloi phat hoeh rah tie na paceipakaw pawiteh na panue han doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kai ni bawkim dawk thoseh, sinakok dawk thoseh, khothung thoseh, lawk kâounnae, tami ruengruengti saknae ka sak hoeh tie hah hetnaw ni a panue awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Atuvah hetnaw ni yon na pen awh e heh ahnimouh ni kapanuekkhaikung tawn awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hatei, bu louk ati awh e lamthung patetlah mintoenaw e Cathut doeh ka bawk tie nange hmalah ka kampangkhai. Kai teh kâlawknaw dawk a thut e hoi, profet cauknaw dawk a thut e pueng hai ka yuem teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />ahnimouh ni a ngaihawi awh e patetlah tami kalannaw hoi tamikalan hoeh e naw hai a to hmalah bout a thaw awh han tie hah ka ngaihawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, kai teh Cathut hmalah hoi tami hmalah yon toun han kaawm hoeh e thoehawi panuenae kapek thai hanlah ouk ka panki.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Atu kum moi asaw hnukkhu, ka miphunnaw koe poehnonaw poe hane hoi thuengnae sak hanelah kai teh ka tho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bawkim dawk thoungnae ka coe tangcoung e kai hah ahnimouh ni na hmu awh navah tami kamkhueng e awmhoeh, ruengruengtinae banghai awmhoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hatei Asia ram hoi ka tho e Judahnaw ao awh. Ahnimouh ni kai lathueng yon pen hane tawn awh pawiteh, bawipa, na hmalah amamouh roeroe a tho awh vaiteh na pen awh hanlah ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nahoeh pawiteh, sanhedrin lawkcengnae hmalah ka kangdue lahun nah bang yonnae maw kai dawk a hmu awh tie hah atu hi kaawm e naw ni roeroe dei awh naseh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kai teh ahnimae hmalah ka kangdue teh, kadout tangcoungnaw boutthaw hringnae hoi kâkuen lah nangmae hmalah akungkhei e lah ka o tie lawk buet touh doeh ka hramkhai telah a dei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Felik ni hote konglamnaw hah kamcengcalah a panue dawkvah, ransabawi Lisias a tho torei nangmae lai teh akung na khei pouh han a titeh a tahruet pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pawl hah khik paung laipalah ring awh. A huikonaw ni a khetyawt awh e hah ngang awh hanh telah ransabawi koe kâ a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A hnin youn touh ao hnukkhu Felik bawi teh Judah napui a yu Drusilla hoi a tho rawi. Pawl hah a kaw teh Khrih Jisuh thung yuemnae kong a dei e hah a thai roi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hatei, Pawl ni a dei e lawk teh lannae, mahoima kâcakuepnae hoi ka tho hane lawkcengnae a dei navah, Felik bawi ni a taki teh la ban ei lawih, a to hmalah atueng ao torei bout na kaw han telah atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hatnavah, Pawl ni tangka na poe han doeh telah Felik bawi ni a ngaihawi dawkvah, atuhoitu a kaw teh lawk a kâpankhai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kum hnin touh ao hnukkhu hoi Felik bawi tahungnae hmuen koe Porsia Festus ni a yueng lah a tahung. Felik bawi ni Judahnaw lunghawi sak hane a ngai dawkvah Pawl hah thongim sut a paung.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Festus siangpahrang teh, hote ram dawk a pha teh hnin thum touh ao hnukkhu Kaisarea khopui hoi Jerusalem kho lah a luen takhang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hahoi vaihma kacue hoi Judahnaw thung dawk e a lungkahanaw ni Pawl teh a toe awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahnimouh ni kaimouh na pahrennae lah, Pawl hah Jerusalem lah na thak pouh loe telah a kâhei awh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, Pawl hah lam vah pawp vaiteh thei awh han telah sut a kâcai awh dawk doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hatnavah Festus siangpahrang ni Pawl hateh, Kaisarea khovah thongim thung ao. Hote kho dawk nâsittouh o hoehnahlan, kama roeroe ka cei han.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hatdawkvah nangmouh thung dawk, kâtawnnae ka tawn e taminaw hah kai koe kâbang awh nateh, ahni yon pen hane awm pawiteh pen awh atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hahoi hnin taroe, hnin hra touh ao hnukkhu vah Kaisarea kho a cei teh, lawkcengnae tungkhung dawk a tahung teh Pawl hah kaw hanelah kâ a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pawl a tho torei teh Jerusalem lahoi ka tho e Judahnaw ni Pawl hah khik a ven awh. Yon a pen awh e pueng a tang e buet touh hai awmhoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pawl ni vah Judah phung thoseh, bawkim thoseh, Sizar siangpahrang thoseh, ka payon hoeh telah a pathung.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Festus siangpahrang ni Judahnaw hah tang sak a ngai dawkvah Pawl hanelah, nang heh Jerusalem cei vaiteh kaie hmalah hete lai heh akungkhei hane na ngai maw telah a pacei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hatei Pawl ni kai heh Sizar siangpahrang e lawkcengnae tungkhung hmalah ka kangdue dawkvah, hote hmuen koe kai heh akung na khei pawiteh a kamcu doeh. Nang ni kacailah na panue e patetlah Judahnaw koe yonnae khoeroe ka sak hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Koe ka payon boilah duekhai kawi yonnae buetbuet touh koe ka sak pawiteh, due hane kangek hoeh. Hateiteh ahnimouh ni yonpen awh e naw heh buet touh hai tueng hoehpawiteh apinihai ahnimae kut dawk na phat sak mahoeh. Sizar siangpahrang koe doeh nganga ka cei han atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hattoteh Festus siangpahrang teh thaw rei ka tawk huinaw hoi a kâpan awh teh, nang teh Sizar siangpahrang koe nganga ka cei han na ti dawkvah Siangpahrang Sizar koe na cei han atipouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hathnukkhu hnin youn touh ao hoiyah Agrippa siangpahrang hoi a yu Bernike teh, Festus hoi kâhmo hanelah, Kaisarea kho a tho roi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hnin hni, hnin thum ao roi hoiyah, Festus ni Pawl e lai hah siangpahrang koe hettelah be a dei pouh. Hivah Felik ni thongim a pabo e tami buet touh ao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Jerusalem ka pha navah, vaihma bawinaw hoi Judah kacuenaw ni ahni hah a toe awh teh rek hanelah a kâhei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hatei, yon pen lah kaawm e tami buet touh heh, yon kapenkung hoi minhmai kâhmo teh yon kâpen e hoi kâkuen lah, bout pathungnae ao hoehnahlan ahni hah alouklah thak pawiteh Romnaw e phung nahoeh telah Judahnaw koe ka dei pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, ahnimouh teh hete khopui dawk a pha awh toteh, pouk laipalah atangtho vah lawkcengnae tungkhung dawk ka tahung teh, ahni hah kaw hanlah kâ ka poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pawl yon ka pen e naw a kangdue awh toteh, ka pouk e patetlah kathoute yonnae hah pen awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahnimae kamcan teh amamae phung lawk hoi ka kâkuen e hoi, yo kadout tangcoung e Jisuh teh bout a hring telah Pawl ni a dei e patetnaw hah doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kai teh het patetlah e kâounkhai e naw heh ka pouk panuek lounglang hoeh dawkvah, Pawl hah Jerusalem vah cei vaiteh hawvah, hete lai heh akungkhei hanelah na ngai ou telah ka pacei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hatei Pawl ni siangpahrang ni lawkceng e totouh na hrueng awh ei telah a kâhei dawkvah, Sizar Siangpahrang koe thak hoehroukrak paung hanelah kâ ka poe toe telah a dei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Agrippa bawi ni Festus bawi hanlah kama roeroe ni a lawk thai han ka ngai atipouh teh Festus ni tangtho to thai lawih atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A tangtho vah Agrippa siangpahrang hoi a yu Bernike teh puenghoi a kamthoup teh, ransa bawinaw, hote khothung e alawkpui lah kaawm e taminaw hoi rei a tho awh teh, impui thung a kâen awh. Hatnavah Festus siangpahrang ni kâ a poe teh Pawl hah a hrawi pouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Festus siangpahrang ni, Agrippa siangpahrang hoi hie kaawm tongpanaw, nangmouh ni na hmu awh e hete tami hoi kâkuen lah, Judahnaw pueng niyah, hete tami heh hring sak kawi nahoeh telah a hramki awh teh, Jerusalem kho thung hai thoseh, hi khothung hai thoseh, kai koe a kâhei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hateiteh, ahni ni duekhai kawi bang buet touh boehai sak hoeh tie hah ka panue. Hatei, ama ni Sizar bawi koe nganga ka cei han ati dawkvah, hawvah thak hanelah ka kâcai toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ahnie a kong teh thut vaiteh siangpahrang nang koe poe hanelah kamceng e a kong buet touh boehai yah kai dawkvah awmhoeh. Hatdawkvah yon pennae buetbuet touh ka thut hane ao nahanelah, nang ni ahni hah akungkhei thai nahan nang na hmalah ka tâcokhai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, thongkabawt e tami buet touh heh a yonnae panuek laipalah patoun pawiteh kamcu mahoeh atipouh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hattoteh Agrippa ni Pawl hanelah, nama e kong nama ni na dei thai toe atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hatdawkvah Pawl ni a kut a dâw teh, Agrippa siangpahrang, Judahnaw niyah kai yon na pen awh e naw hah sahnin nang na hmalah dei nahane atueng ka hmu e heh yawhawinae buet touh lah ka pouk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh siangpahrang nang teh, Judahnaw e singyoe hoi kamcan pueng na panue dawk doeh. Hatdawkvah pahren lahoi ka dei e lawk heh lungsaw lahoi na thai pouh haw telah ka kâhei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kai teh ka miphunnaw koehai thoseh, Jerusalem kho thung hai thoseh, ka nawca hoiyah bangtelamaw kho ka sak tie hah Judahnaw ni koung a panue awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahnimouh ni kanawca hoi na panue awh dawkvah, kai teh kamamae phunglawk dawkvah kacingpounge Farasi buet touh lah ka o tie teh hi kaawm e naw ni dei ngai pawiteh a dei thai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Atuvah kai teh mintoenaw koe Cathut ni poe lah kaawm e lawkkam ngaihawinae kecu dawk lawk na ceng awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kaimae miphun hlaikahni touh ni, karum khodai thahmei laihoi Cathut a bawk awh teh, hote lawkkam patetlah coe hane a ngaihawi awh. Siangpahrang, kai teh hete ngaihawinae dawk doeh Judahnaw ni yon na pen awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka dout tangcoung e taminaw teh Cathut ni a thaw sak han tie hah yuem hanlah awmhoeh telah nangmouh ni teh khuet na ti a vaw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Atangcalah kai roeroe haiyah Nazareth tami Jisuh min hah taran han telah doeh ka pouk van teh Jerusalem vah hottelah doeh ka kâroe van.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kai teh vaihma bawinaw koehoi kâtawnnae ka hmu teh, tami kathoung moikapap hah thongim thung ka paung teh, ahnimouh thei awh nahai ka lungkuepkhai van.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sinakok tangkuem hai ahnimanaw hah atuhoitu runae ka poe teh, Cathut dudamnae lawk ngangngang ka dei sak. Hothloilah ahnimouh koe ka lungkhuek teh kho louk lah totouh ka pâlei teh ouk ka rektap.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hottelah hoiyah, ahnimouh rektap hanelah vaihma bawinaw ni kâtawnnae na poe e lahoi Damaskas kho lah ka cei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kanîthun vah lam dawk kanî angnae hlak ka ang e kalvan hoi e ni kai hoi ka huinaw abuemlae tengpam pueng koe pheng a tue e hah ka hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kaimouh abuemlahoi talai lah koung ka rawp awh teh, Hebru lawk lahoi Sawl, Sawl bangkong kai na rektap. Sâw na pathui hane teh a pataw kaima, telah a dei e ka thai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hatnavah, kai ni Bawipa nang teh apimaw telah ka pacei navah Bawipa ni, kai teh nang ni na rektap e Jisuh doeh telah ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thaw nateh na khok hoi kangdout leih. Nang koe ka kamnue ngainae teh Kai koe na hmu e naw hoi, bout na hmu hane naw hah kampangkhai hanelah nang teh na rawi toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kai ni Judah miphunnaw e kut dawk hoi thoseh, Jentelnaw e kut dawk hoi hai thoseh, nang teh na rungngang han. Ahnimouh koe nang teh na patoun toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hethateh, ahnimae mit na ang sak vaiteh ahnimouh teh hmonae um hoi angnae koe lah na rasa vaiteh, Setan kâtawnnae thung hoi Cathut koe lah kâthungsak vaiteh, ahnimouh ni Kai na yuem e lahoi yon ngaithoumnae a coe awh vaiteh, thoungsaknae ka coe e naw thungvah, a kâthum awh thai nahane doeh atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hatdawkvah, Agrippa siangpahrang kai ni kalvanlae vision hah ka ek thai hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ahmaloe poung lah Damaskas kho kaawm e naw, hathnukkhu Jerusalem kho kaawm e naw hoi Judah ram dawk kaawm e tami pueng koehoi Jentel miphun pueng koehai pankângai vaiteh Cathut koe kâthung hanelah pankângainae hoi kamcu e naw hah na sak awh nahanelah ka pâpho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hete kongnaw dawkvah Judahnaw ni bawkim vah na man awh teh thei hanelah a kâcai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hatei, kai teh Cathut pahren lungmanae ka coe dawkvah sahnin totouh tami kathoeng kalen hanelah kampangkhai lahun e lah ka o. Hottelah kampangkhai navah, a to hmalah ka tâcawt han telah Mosi hoi profetnaw ni sut a dei tangcoung e hloilah alouke ka dei e awmhoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahnimouh ni a dei awh e teh, Khrih teh runae a khang hoi duenae koehoi apasuekpoung lah boutthawnae lahoi Isarelnaw hoi Jentelnaw koe angnae kamthang a pâpho pouh han tie doeh telah a dei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pawl ni hettelah a pâpho navah, Festus siangpahrang ni, Pawl nang teh na pathu toe. Ka tapuet lah na kamtunae ni na pathu sak toe telah hram laihoi a dei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hatei, Pawl ni Festus siangpahrang, kai ka pathu e nahoeh. Lawkkatang hoi ka talue e lawk doeh ka dei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Agrippa siangpahrang ni hete kongnaw hah a panue dawkvah lungtang laihoi a dei. Hete kongnaw teh arulae a tho hoeh dawkvah, siangpahrang nang ni na panue hoeh e awm mahoeh telah ka pouk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Agrippa siangpahrang, profet lawknaw hah na yuem maw. Na yuem doeh tie ka panue atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hattoteh Agrippa siangpahrang ni, nang ni na dei e lahoi kai hai khristen lah meimei ka coung toe ati.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Pawl ni, bawipa nang dueng laipalah sahnin ka lawk ka thai e tami pueng ni hete sumrui hoi pâkhi e hloilah kai patetlah koung na o awh nahan Cathut koe ka ratoum atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hahoi, Siangpahrang hoi Bernike hoi ateng ka tahung e pueng a thaw awh teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />a tâco awh hnukkhu, hete tami teh, duekhai kawi, hoehpawiteh, katekkhai kawi yonnae buet touh boehai kahmawt hoeh telah buet touh hoi buet touh a kâpankhai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Agrippa siangpahrang ni Festus koe, hete tami ni Sizar koe nganga ka dei han tet hoehpawiteh hlout sak hanlah ao atipouh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Itali ram lah long hoi na cei han na ti pouh awh navah, Pawl hoi alouke thongkabawtnaw hai siangpahrang e ransa hu thung e ransabawi Julius koevah a poe awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Asia ram long kâhatnae kho koe lahoi pou ka cet hane long ka kâcui awh teh ka cei awh. Masidonia ram Thesalon tami Aristarkas hai kaimouh hoi a cei van.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Atangtho teh Sidon ka pha awh. Julius ni Pawl hah a lungma dawkvah a huinaw koe a ceisak teh ahnimae khetyawtnae hah a coe sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Haw hoi vah ka tâco awh teh kahlî hah kaimouh koe lah a kamlang dawkvah Saipras tuilum e kahlî a uepnae koe lahoi ka cei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hahoi Cilicia hoi Pamfilia tueng koe ka raka awh teh Licia khopui Mira vah ka pha awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Haw tueng vah ransabawi ni Alexandria kho hoi Itali kho lah ka cet hane long buet touh a hmu teh hote long dawkvah na kâcui sak awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hnin kapap hnawn payai lahoi ka cei awh teh rucat laihoi Kanidas kho teng ka pha thai awh. Kaimouh teh kahlî kecu dawk patuen ka cei thai awh hoeh dawkvah, Krete tuilum kahlî a uepnae koe lahoi ka cei awh teh Salmon talaidawn koehoi pet ka cei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuipui rai lahoi nganga pou ka cei awh teh Lasea kho teng lungmawng tie long kâhatnae hmuen koe ka pha awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Haw e hmuen koevah hnin moi kasawlah ka roe awh teh rawcahainae hnin hai aloum toung dawkvah, hmalah cei hane hai taki a tho dawkvah Pawl ni na hroecoe awh atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hmaunawnghanaw hete tuipui dawk ceinae heh long hoi hnopainaw dawk dueng laipalah, maimae hringnae dawk hai runae na poe hanelah ao tie hah ka hmu telah a dei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hateiteh ransabawi ni Pawl e lawk hah tang laipalah, long kamawngkung hoi long katawnkung e lawk hah bet atanghnawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hote long kâhatnae koe vah kasik thapa thung pueng o hanelah a coung hoeh dawkvah, tami kapap ni kanîloumaka lah hoi kanîloumatung lah pou cei vaiteh, Krete tuilum e Finik hmuen koe pha han a ngai awh. Hawvah kasik thapa pueng o hanelah a pouk awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Akalah hoi kahlî a tho toteh khokhang awh e patetlah akuep han doeh telah a pouk awh. Hatdawkvah sumtaai hah a phawk awh teh, Krete tuilum teng lahoi a cei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hateiteh, atueng a ro hoehnahlan vah kanîtho koe lahoi yah, Euroquilo kahlî katang e hah a tho.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Long ni kahlî a hmang thai hoeh toung dawkvah longhni pueng ka rasu awh teh, kahlî ni a paleknae koe doeh ka cei awh toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kawda tuilum teng, kahlî a uepnae koe ka pha awh toteh, ka ru poung lahoi hloutnae longca hah ka kuet thai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hote longca hah Long van vah a pâhung awh teh long hah acak nahanlah rui hoi kacaklah a katek awh. Sadi mon dawkvah hmang payon vai ati awh teh lukkarei longhni a rahnoum sak awh teh long hah kahlî a palek sak awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kaimouh teh kahlî ni puenghoi na hmang awh dawkvah, atangtho teh long dawk e hnonaw hah a tâkhawng awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Apâthum hnin teh amamae kut hoi long dawk e hnonaw hah a tâkhawng awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A hnin moi kasawlah Kanî, Âsinaw hmawt awh hoeh. Tâlî hai hoehoe a tho dawkvah, a hnukteng teh hlout awh han doeh tie ngaihawinae pueng a kahma toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hottelah taminaw teh rawca laipalah kasawlah ao awh dawkvah, Pawl teh ahnimouh hmalah a kangdue teh, hmaunawnghanaw kaie lawk hah na ngai a lah, Krete tuilum koehoi tâcawt laipalah awm awh pawiteh, hete runae hoi sungnae pueng heh kâhmo awh mahoeh ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hatei atuteh na lungpout awh han awh, telah na dei pouh awh. Nangmouh thung dawk hoi api buet touh boehai na dout a mahoeh, long dueng doeh rawk tih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, kai na katawnkung ka bawk e Cathut e kalvantami ni paduem tangmin vah ka teng a kangdue teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pawl, na lungpuen hanh, siangpahrang hmalah na kangdue mingming han doeh. Hahoi Cathut ni nang hoi rei ka tho e pueng hai na kut dawk na poe toe a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hatdawkvah ka huinaw na lungpout a hanh awh. Bangkongtetpawiteh, na dei pouh e patetlah ao han tie Cathut kâuep laihoi ka yuem doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Maimouh hai tuilum buetbuet touh dawk long heh a mang han toe telah Pawl ni a dei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hnin hlaipali hnin tangmin a pha navah kaimouh teh Adria tuipui dawk kâpayo awh lahun navah, karumsaning a pha toteh long teh tui kongteng buetbuet touh hoi a hnai toe telah ka pouk awh teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />tui hah ka bangnue awh bo teh, lam 20 touh a dung tie ka panue awh. Dongdeng o hnukkhu bout ka bangnue awh bo teh, lam hlaipanga touh a dung e ka panue awh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ahnimouh teh lungsongnaw hmang langvaih tie a taki awh dawkvah, sumtaai pali touh a pabo awh teh, khodai lawiseh telah a ratoum awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Long kamawngnaw teh yawng hanelah a kâcai awh dawkvah, sumtaai ka pabawt e boiboe lah a kâsak awh teh hloutnae longca hah a rui a rasu awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pawl ni ransabawi hoi ransanaw koevah, long thung na awm awh hoeh pawiteh, na hlout awh mahoeh atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hattoteh ransanaw ni hloutnae longca a ruinaw thoukthouk a tâtueng pouh teh tui thung a pabo awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Khodai tawmlei nah Pawl ni abuemlah bu ca hane a dei pouh teh, nangmouh hah bu na cahoehnae hah atuvah hnin hlaipali touh a pha toe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hatdawkvah bu na ca awh nahanlah kai ni hroecoe awh. Hot hateh nangmouh na hlout awh nahane doeh. Nangmae na lû dawk e sam buet touh boehai kahmat mahoeh atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hettelah a dei hnukkhu vah, Pawl ni vaiyei hah a la teh abuemlae hmalah Cathut koe lunghawi lawk a dei hnukkhu vaiyei a raen teh a ca.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Hattoteh ahnimanaw abuemlah ni hai a thahmei awh teh a ca awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Long dawkvah tami 276 touh ao awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Rawca kaboumlah a ca awh hnukkhu long dawk e catunnaw hah tui dawk a tâkhawng awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Khodai torei teh haw e a hmuen teh panuek awh hoeh eiteh, a kawngteng kaawm e a takin koe lah long kâhat sak hanlah a kâpan awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Hahoi sumtaainaw hah a rasu awh teh tui dawk a pabo awh, mawngnae acung rui kalennaw a rasu awh teh, longhni a thung awh teh a kawngteng lah a cei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Hatei Long teh tuicapa kahni touh kâcunae koe a pha dawkvah, long e a lû teh sadi van a deng teh, kâhuen thai hoeh toe. Ataknaw teh tuicapa ni a hem dawk koung a rawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Ransanaw ni thongkabawtnaw pueng yawng awh langvaih, hatdawkvah be thei han toe telah a pouk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Hateiteh, ransabawi ni Pawl hlout sak hanelah a ngai dawkvah, ahnimae pouknae a ngang pouh teh, tui kale thainaw hmaloe a kawngteng lah kale sak hane,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />alouke taminaw ni thingphek raboung naseh. Long dawk e hnopai buetbuet touh nakunghai, kuet laihoi kale hanelah kâ a poe. Hettelah hoi abuemlahoi kongteng lah runae awm laipalah koung a hlout awh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kaimouh teh lungmawngcalah hoi a kongteng ka pha awh hnukkhu vah hote tuilum teh Malta tuilum doeh tie ka panue awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tamipathunaw ni kaimouh koe lungpatawnae a kamnue sak awh. Kho a rak teh hroung a pâding dawkvah hmai a patawi awh teh kaimouh abuemlah na kamben sak awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pawl ni thingnaw a racum navah a thung hoi tahrun kathout a tâco teh Pawl e a kut dawk a khue pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tamipathunaw ni Pawl e kut dawk lawng kanghoi e tahrun hah a hmu awh navah, hete tami heh tami ka thet e han doeh, tui dawk hoi a hlout ei nakunghai, phunglawk ni hring sak han ngai hoeh telah buet touh hoi buet touh a kâpankhai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pawl ni hote tahrun hah hmai dawk a kathek, hatei, ama teh bangtelah hai awmhoeh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahni teh a takbuem a phing han, a kamlei vaiteh a due han, titeh a ring awh. Hatei, bangtelah hai ao hoeh torei teh a lungkâthung awh teh hete tami teh cathut han doeh atipouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hote hmuen koehoi a hnainae koe vah Publius telah kaw e tuilum khobawi e talai ao. Hote khobawi ni kaimanaw na o sak hloilah hnin thum touh thung rawca totouh na khetyawt awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Publius khobawi e a na pa teh a pâding e hoi a vontamci lah a pataw teh sut a yan. Hatnavah Pawl ni a kâen sin teh a ratoum pouh hnukkhu a kut a toung pouh teh a dam sak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hettelah a hnosak e a hmu awh navah tuilum kho kaawm e kapatawnaw pueng a thokhai awh teh damnae a coe awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahnimanaw ni barinae a sin awh teh na bari awh, ka ban awh to hai panki e naw moi a pâseng awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thapa yung thum touh hnukkhu, tuilum koe kaawm e, kut sak kahrai ca kamphei e mei kâbet e Alexandria long hoi ka cei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sirakus kho ka pha awh teh hote kho dawk hnin thum touh ka roe awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Haw hoi bout ka cei awh teh Regium kho ka pha awh. Atangtho vah akalae kahlî a tho dawkvah apâhni hnin vah Puteoli kho ka pha awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hote kho dawk hmaunawnghanaw hoi kâhmo awh teh hnin sari touh o hanelah na coun awh. Hettelah hoi Rom kho ka pha awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kaimae kamthang ka thai e Rom kho e hmaunawnghanaw teh kaimouh hoi kâhmo hanelah, Rom kho hoi Appius hno yonae hoi bangla kathum touh tie totouh a tho awh. Pawl ni ahnimouh a hmu nah, Cathut koe lunghawi lawk a dei teh a thahmei awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Rom kho a pha awh toteh Pawl teh ama ka ring hane ransa buet touh hoi aloukcalah o hanelah ransabawi ni kâ a poe.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hnin thum touh hnukkhu, Pawl ni Judah kahrawikungnaw a kaw teh, a kamkhueng sak teh, hmaunawnghanaw kai ni Judah miphun ahawihoehnae ka sak hoeh. Mintoenaw e singyoe hai ka pahnawt hoeh. Jerusalem kho thongim na pabo awh, Romnaw e kut dawk na hnawng awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Romnaw ni lawk bout na pacei awh hnukkhu, due han kamcu e yonnae a hmu awh hoeh dawkvah hlout sak hanelah a ngai awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Judahnaw ni a ngai awh hoeh torei teh, Sizar siangpahrang koe nganga ka cet e doeh. Ka taminaw koe yon pen han bangcahai ka tawn hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hete kong dawk nangmouh na kâhmo teh kâpan han ka ngai dawk na kaw awh e doeh. Isarel miphunnaw ni ngaihawinae kong dawkvah, hete sumbawtarui hoi kai teh na pâkhi awh atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hattoteh ahnimanaw ni, nange kong dawk Judah ram hoi ca ka hmawt awh hoeh. Haw hoi ka tho e hmaunawnghanaw apinihai nang dawk na yon telah ka dei e awmhoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hatei, hete bawknae hoi kâkuen lah, kho tangkuem vah na taran awh teh, na pathoe awh tie hah kaimouh ni sut ka panue dawkvah, nang ni bangtelamaw na pouk tie kaimouh ni thai hanelah ka ngai atipouh awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hathnukkhu Pawl hoi hnin a kâdawk awh teh, ahni a luennae koe hoe kapap lah a tho awh. Pawl ni amom hoi tangmin lah ditouh ahnimouh koe Cathut uknaeram kong a cangkhai, a kampangkhai teh, Mosi e kâlawk hoi Profetnaw ni a thut e naw hno lahoi Jisuh kong hah a dei pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Atangawn teh Pawl ni a dei e hah a yuem awh. Atangawnnaw teh yuem awh hoeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Hottelah buet touh hoi buet touh lungkânging hoeh hoi a cei awh navah, Pawl ni lawkkam touh a dei e teh, Kathoung Muitha ni Profet Isaiah hno lahoi a dei e hah atang doeh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Cet nateh dei pouh, a thai awh han ei thai panuek awh mahoeh, a hmu awh han ei hmawt panuek a mahoeh atipouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Bangkongtetpawiteh, ahnimouh teh a hnâpang, a mitdawn awh teh, a lungthin kamlang awh hoeh. Hoehpawiteh, a mit hoi hmawt awh vaiteh, hnâ hoi thai awh vaiteh, a lung hoi a thaipanuek awh vaiteh, kâthung awh vaiteh, kai ni ka dam sak han a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hatdawkvah Cathut e rungngangnae teh Jentelnaw koe poe lah ao toung dawkvah, ahnimanaw ni teh a ngai awh han tie hah panuek awh telah Pawl ni a dei pouh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hete lawk hah Pawl ni a dei navah, Judahnaw teh thouk a kâoun awh teh a ban awh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Kum hni touh thung Pawl teh im a hlai e dawk a o, ama koe ka tho e naw pueng a luen sak teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />banghai tarawknae awm laipalah, Cathut uknaeram kong hah, taranhawi laihoi a pâpho teh, Bawipa Jisuh Khrih e a kongnaw hah a cangkhai.
  </para>
</usx>
